  ('APP_w058_epbMia', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the EPB ECU is not received, making EPB status unknown.', 'The Autopilot ECU starts receiving expected messages from the EPB ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the Autopilot electronic control unit (ECU) receives periodically from the electronic parking brake (EPB) ECU is not received, indicating the EPB ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Autopilot features may be unavailable, or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 81),
