  ('APP_w230_alcUltrasoundBlocked', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'Autopilot ECU detects one or more ultrasonic sensors as blocked while ALC is initiated.', 'Autopilot ECU no longer detects any ultrasonic sensors as blocked.', 'Auto lane change (ALC) is unavailable due to Autopilot electronic control unit (ECU) detecting blocked ultrasonic sensors.', 'Auto lane change (ALC) feature is unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 235),
