  ('APP_w286_gpsComIssue', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The Autopilot ECU encounters errors when attempting to communicate with the GPS receiver. Alert log signal data should provide more information on specific condition(s) detected.', 'The Autopilot ECU no longer detects errors when communicating with the GPS receiver.', 'The Autopilot electronic control unit (ECU) encountered errors while communicating with the GPS receiver.', 'Autopilot features depending on GPS may not be available, or may not function as expected. Effects on functionality may vary depending on how long the errors persist.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 272),
