  ('BCCEN_w108_immobOperationFault', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Immobilizer was unable to respond to a DI mobilization request', 'Immobilizer did respond successfully to a DI mobilization request', 'This alert is for debug. It will indicate why the immobilizer was unable to mobilize.', 'If this alert is continuously set, the vehicle may not be able to drive', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 703),
