  ('BCCEN_w111_LFAntErrorFront', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Sets when antenna error is detected by the BCCEN', 'Clears when BCCEN attempts another LF operation and no antenna errors are detected as a result', 'The exact location of the key cannot be determined. Since the center and left antenna are most important for passive entry, these functions will probably still work. There is a chance that functions are reduced.', 'Passive entry and key authentication functionality reduced', 'Limited auto present door functionality', 'May require BCCEN replacement', 'service-fix', 706),
  ('BCCEN_w112_LFAntErrorRear', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Sets when antenna error is detected by the BCCEN', 'Clears when BCCEN attempts another LF operation and no antenna errors are detected as a result', 'The exact location of the key cannot be determined. Since the center and left antenna are most important for passive entry, these functions will probably still work. There is a chance that functions are reduced.', 'Passive entry and key authentication functionality reduced', 'Limited auto present door functionality', 'May require BCCEN replacement', 'service-fix', 707),
  ('BCCEN_w113_LFAntErrorCenter', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Sets when antenna error is detected by the BCCEN', 'Clears when BCCEN attempts another LF operation and no antenna errors are detected as a result', 'The center antenna is responsible for all key fob authentication processes. Without the center console antenna, auto-present doors, key authentication and dead key fob functionality are not available.', 'Passive entry, key authentication and dead keyfob drive authentication not available', 'Limited auto present door functionality', 'May require BCCEN replacement', 'service-fix', 708),
  ('BCCEN_w114_LFAntErrorDriver', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Sets when antenna error is detected by the BCCEN', 'Clears when BCCEN attempts another LF operation and no antenna errors are detected as a result', 'Auto-present of the driver door will not function. Be aware that Auto-close still works because the vehicle doesn''t need to know the exact location of the key for that. If the key is out of range of any of the antennas, the door will close.', 'Passive entry, key authentication and dead keyfob entry not available', 'Limited auto present door functionality', 'May require BCCEN replacement', 'service-fix', 709),
