  ('BCFALCD_a165_PinchObsDetected', 'Model X 2021+', 'Pinch strip was pressed while the door was moving or when a movement request was received.', 'New Falcon door movement request is received.', 'One of the two Falcon pinch strip sensor was pressed and stopped the door movement.', 'Falcon door will either stop if in motion, or reject movement request if static.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 758),
