  ('BCFALCD_a177_USSDoorResonanceErr', 'Model X 2021+', 'The ultrasonic sensor reports a resonance period outside of the expected range.', 'The ultrasonic sensor reports a resonance period within the expected range.', 'The Falcon Door Body Controller has detected the resonance period reported by the ultrasonic sensor is out of bounds.', 'The ultrasonic sensor may be unable to detect obstacles in the door''s path.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 763),
