  ('BCFALCD_a188_doorMvmtUSSNoChange', 'Model X 2021+', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor continually detects an obstacle at a distance that does not change, even though the door should be getting closer to the obstacle as it opens, indicating a false positive.', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor does not detect an obstacle at a constant distance while moving, or the door has come to a full stop.', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor has detected an object that is likely to be a false positive, and that presumably does not exist.', 'The rear door might not move, or might stop unexpectedly while opening.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 770),
  ('BCFALCD_a193_openToFitUsed', 'Model X 2021+', 'Detected obstacle is limiting allowed door space and is preventing a full quick open actuation.', 'Door is not in the open to fit state anymore.', 'Falcon door is using the open to fit state due to a detected obstacle limiting the door opening space. See alert payload for more information on the limit source.', 'The Falcon door will not open fully and adjust its maximum opening position based on detected obstacles.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 771),
