  ('BCFALCP_w070_USS_canBusOff', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'Occurs whenever the CAN bus responsible for USS communication shuts down unexpectedly or intentionally.', 'Normal operating conditions resume upon reactivation of the USS CAN bus.', 'The CAN bus connected to the Falcon Door Ultrasonic Sensor (USS) has been detected as offline.', 'An offline CAN bus can lead to intermittent faltering, complete failure, or decreased performance in ultrasonic sensor functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1040),
