  ('BCFALCP_w072_USS_LHInwardLINerr', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'LIN communication between the Falcon Door and left Falcon door''s inner ultrasonic sensor has been disconnected or interrupted.', 'LIN communication between the Falcon Door and left Falcon door''s inner ultrasonic sensor is reconnected.', 'Communication through Local Interconnect Network (LIN) with the left-side inward-facing Ultrasonic Sensor (USS) in the Falcon Door System has been disconnected or interrupted.', 'Loss of LIN communication can impact Falcon Door system functionality including obstructive awareness, motion management, and protection mechanisms.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1042),
