  ('BCFALCP_w188_doorMvmtUSSNoChange', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor continually detects an obstacle at a distance that does not change, even though the door should be getting closer to the obstacle as it opens, indicating a false positive.', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor does not detect an obstacle at a constant distance while moving, or the door has come to a full stop.', 'The rear door''s ultrasonic sensor has detected an object that is likely to be a false positive, and that presumably does not exist.', 'The rear door might not move, or might stop unexpectedly while opening.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1107),
