  ('BCFDM_a072_UnexpectLatchClosed', 'Model X 2021+', 'The door latch status transitioned to CLOSING or CLOSED while the door opening angle exceeded the threshold value.', 'A new door opening or closing request is received.', 'The door latch is closed while the door angle is outside the latch closing zone.', 'The door latch was manually closed, or the door motor encoder is incorrectly reporting the door position.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1116),
