  ('BCFDM_w064_LatchReleaseError', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'PFD transitions from LATCH_OPENING to CLOSED_BRAKE or OPENED_BRAKE', 'PFD transitions from LATCH_OPENING to OPENING', 'Check alertLog for more information. If resultingState is CLOSED_BRAKE, the latch''s OPEN switch may be disconnected. If previousState is OPENED_BRAKE, the latch''s switches and release motor may be all disconnected.', 'PFD cannot open automatically', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1188),
