  ('BCFDM_w105_ECUDebugMode', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'ECU Debug Jumper is set.', 'ECU Debug Jumper is NOT set.', 'Production vehicle should not have Debug Jumper in place. Remove jumper from ECU.', 'ECU Debug Jumper will disable SBC watchdog, preventing external watchdog reset protection.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 1214),
