  ('BMS_a051_SW_HVC_Vref_Bad', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'There is a significant difference between the BMS and High Voltage Processor (HVP) voltage reference readings.', 'The difference between the BMS and HVP voltage readings are below the maximum threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that one or more High Voltage Controller (HVC) voltage references is out of bounds.', ' The vehicle may report inaccurate voltage measurements leading to alerts from the HV system.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2151),
  ('BMS_a052_SW_PCS_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received the expected response from the PCS CAN.', 'The BMS has received the expected messages from the PCS CAN.', 'The Battery Management System is not receiving the expected CAN messages from the power conversion system (PCS).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2152),
  ('BMS_a059_SW_Pack_Voltage_Sensing', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the HV pack voltage differs from the sum of the brick voltages by more than 3%.', 'The BMS detects that the HV pack voltage is within 3% of the sum of the brick voltages.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a mismatch between the pack voltage and the sum of brick voltages.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2153),
  ('BMS_a062_SW_BrickV_Imbalance', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has detected that the difference between the maximum brick voltage and the minimum brick voltage in the high voltage (HV) pack is greater than expected.', 'The BMS has detected that the difference between the maximum brick voltage and the minimum brick voltage is within the threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that there is a brick voltage imbalance.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2154),
  ('BMS_a063_SW_ChargePort_Fault', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The hardline from the CP to the BMS is active.', 'The hardline from the CP to the BMS is cleared / no longer active.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected a condition affecting charge port (CP) functionality, making vehicle charging unavailable.', 'Vehicle charging is unavailable.', 'Unable to charge', 'Disconnect and retry', 'customer;service-fix', 2155),
  ('BMS_a064_SW_SOC_Imbalance', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the difference between the most-charged brick and the least-charge brick in the high voltage (HV) pack is greater than the acceptable threshold.', 'The BMS has detected that the difference between the maximum brick voltage and the minimum brick voltage is below the acceptable threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a possible state of charge (SOC) imbalance.', 'Maximum SOC is reduced to 50%.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2156),
  ('BMS_a065_SW_CAC_Imbalance', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The estimated imbalance between the average CAC and minimum CAC within a single module exceeds the imbalance threshold.', 'The estimated imbalance between the average CAC and minimum CAC within a single module is within the acceptable imbalance threshold.', 'The Calculated Amp-hour Capacity (CAC) difference of bricks within a module exceeds the acceptable threshold. This results in reduced battery performance and limits maximum range.', 'Maximum charge and discharge current limits and maximum energy available are reduced, causing reduced battery performance and reduced maximum range.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2157),
  ('BMS_a066_SOC_Imbalance_Warning', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The estimated imbalance between average SOC and min SOC > SOC_IMBALANCE_WARNING_SET_THRESHOLD', 'The estimated imbalance between average SOC and min SOC < (SOC_IMBALANCE_WARNING_SET_THRESHOLD - SOC_IMBALANCE_CLEAR_HYSTERESIS)', 'This alert is an early warning for a064 SOC Imbalance, which limits the battery''s max SOC. It triggers with a lower threshold than SOC imbalance.', 'Indication that brick imbalance is increasing and may result in a064, which limits max charge', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2158),
  ('BMS_a067_CAC_Imbalance_Limiting', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the estimated CAC imbalance between the average CAC and the minimum CAC of bricks within a single module exceeds the acceptable threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the estimated CAC imbalance between the average CAC and the minimum CAC of bricks within a single module is within the acceptable threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the calculated Amp-hour capacity (CAC) difference between bricks within a single module exceeds the acceptable threshold, which may reduce battery performance.', 'Battery performance may be limited, which may reduce maximum range and may limit charging performance.', 'High voltage battery performance limited', 'OK to drive - Schedule service soon', 'customer;service-fix', 2159),
  ('BMS_a068_CAC_Imbalance_Limp', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The estimated imbalance between the average CAC and minimum CAC within a single module exceeds the alert set threshold (CAC imbalance is not within acceptable range)', 'The estimated CAC imbalance is under the alert clear threshold (CAC imbalance is within acceptable range)', 'Calculated Amp-hour Capacity (CAC) difference of bricks within a module exceeds acceptable threshold. This results in reduced battery performance and limits maximum range. Vehicle enters Battery Management System (BMS) limp mode.', 'Maximum charge and discharge current limits and maximum energy available are reduced, causing reduced battery performance and limiting maximum range. BMS limp mode is triggered, with another alert present to indicate this condition.', 'High voltage battery requires service', 'Acceleration and charging performance reduced', 'customer;service-fix', 2160),
  ('BMS_a069_SW_Low_Power', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the SOC is below the threshold to support driving.', 'The BMS detects that the SOC is high enough to support driving.', 'The BMS detects that the state of charge (SOC) of the high voltage (HV) battery is too low to support driving.', 'The vehicle begins end-of-drive ramp down.', 'Battery charge level low', 'Charge now', 'customer;service-fix', 2161),
  ('BMS_a070_BrickV_Imbalance_Limiting', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The difference between max brick voltage and min brick voltage is above the brickV imbalance set threshold', 'The difference between max brick voltage and min brick voltage is below the brickV imbalance clear threshold', 'The difference between max brick voltage and min brick voltage is greater than the allowed threshold.', 'Vehicle drive performance is degraded and vehicle will not charge', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2162),
  ('BMS_a071_SW_SM_TransCon_Not_Met', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A blocking condition does not allow the BMS to transition into the requested state.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) cannot transition into the requested state because of a blocking condition.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2163),
  ('BMS_a074_Max_Charge_Level_Reduced', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more Battery Management System (BMS) alerts that reduce the maximum charge limit are set.', 'Vehicle is not connected to a charger or the alerts causing this condition are cleared.', 'The maximum charge level of the battery is limited by one or more alerts.', 'Maximum charge is reduced.', 'Maximum battery charge level reduced', 'OK to drive - Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2164),
  ('BMS_a075_SW_Chg_Disable_Failure', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The HV battery is charging and the BMS detects a condition that prevents it from disabling the charge session.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected a condition that prevents it from disabling the charge session.', 'This alert is primarily informational and used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2165),
  ('BMS_a076_SW_Dch_While_Charging', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the HV pack has been discharged to below the set threshold while charging.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the high voltage (HV) battery is not charging enough while in a charging state.', 'Inability to charge', 'Weak power source', 'Unable to charge battery', 'customer', 2166),
  ('BMS_a077_SW_Charger_Regulation', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'While charging, the maximum brick voltage or charge current exceeded the target value for too long.', 'The BMS reports the brick voltage or charge current is less than the maximum target value and charging ends.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has stopped charging because the maximum brick voltage within the High Voltage (HV) battery or the charge current exceeded the target values for too long.', 'Charging is temporarily unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2167),
  ('BMS_a078_Rapid_Dch_While_Charging', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The discharge current is above an acceptable threshold while DC charging is enabled', 'The charge session has been shut down', 'The BMS has detected high discharge current during DC charge session.', 'The vehicle will not charge until the charge cable is removed and the alert is cleared', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2168),
  ('BMS_a079_Max_Charge_Level_Exceeded', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more Battery Management System (BMS) alerts that reduce the maximum charge limit are set, and the instantaneous charge level is higher than that limit.', 'The HV battery''s charge level falls below the reduced maximum charge limit.', 'The maximum charge level of the high voltage (HV) battery is exceeded.', 'Vehicle will not be able to charge if connected to a power source, as the reduced maximum HV battery charge level is exceeded.', 'Unable to charge - Maximum charge level reached', 'Reduced maximum charge level - Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2169),
  ('BMS_a081_SW_Ctr_Close_Blocked', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One more BMS alerts that prevents pack contactors from closing is present.', 'There are no alerts present that prevent the contactors from closing.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has prevented pack contactors from closing due to one or more other alerts.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2170),
  ('BMS_a082_SW_Ctr_Force_Open', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more BMS alerts that force pack contactors are open.', 'There are no alerts present that force the contactors open.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) forced pack contactors open due to one or more alerts.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2171),
  ('BMS_a083_SW_Ctr_Close_Failure', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects a condition that prevents it from closing pack contactors.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) was unable to close pack contactors.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2172),
  ('BMS_a085_SW_Pack_Contactor_Mismatch', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'High voltage processor (HVP) comms are OK and pack contactors were closed and pack contactors are now open / opening and BMS_packContactorRequest has remained closed.', 'HVP_packContactorSetState is correct for the current BMS_packContactorRequest.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a mismatch between the actual and commanded pack contactor set state.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle shutting down - PULL OVER SAFELY', 'Operation may be restored on next drive', 'customer;service-fix', 2173),
  ('BMS_a086_SW_FC_Contactor_Mismatch', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'High voltage processor (HVP) comms are ok and fast charge contactors were closed and fast charge contactors are now open / opening and BMS_fcContactorRequest has remained closed.', 'HVP_fcContactorSetState is correct for the current BMS_fcContactorRequest.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a mismatch between actual and commanded fast charge (FC) contactor set state. .', 'DC charging is terminated.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2174),
  ('BMS_a087_SW_Feim_Test_Blocked', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects the FEIM is blocked due to another condition on the vehicle. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific reason.', 'The FEIM is no longer blocked and is able to run.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a Force External Isolation Test (FEIM) is required but is blocked due to a condition on the vehicle.', 'The vehicle may be unable to drive.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2175),
  ('BMS_a088_SW_VcFront_MIA_InDrive', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received one more expected CAN messages from VCFRONT while in drive.', 'The BMS receives all expected CAN messages from VCFRONT while the vehicle is in drive.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that vehicle controller front (VCFRONT) is missing (MIA) while the vehicle is in driving.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2176),
  ('BMS_a089_SW_VcFront_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received one more expected CAN messages from VCFRONT while not in drive.', 'The BMS receives all expected CAN messages from VCFRONT while the vehicle is not in drive.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that vehicle controller front (VCFRONT) is missing (MIA) while the vehicle is not in a drive state.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2177),
  ('BMS_a090_SW_Gateway_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) does not receive the expected CAN messages from the  vehicle gateway (GTW) during a certain amount of time.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) receives a CAN message from the  vehicle gateway (GTW).', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects the vehicle gateway (GTW) as unavailable (MIA). BMS functions that depend on messages from the GTW may be unavailable.', 'Battery management system (BMS) functions that depend on messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2178),
  ('BMS_a091_SW_ChargePort_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received one or more expected  CAN messages from the CP.', 'The BMS receives all expected CAN messages from the CP.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the charge port (CP) is missing (MIA). .', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service', 2179),
  ('BMS_a092_SW_ChargePort_Mia_On_Hvs', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received one or more expected  CAN messages from the CP.', 'The BMS receives all expected CAN messages from the CP.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the charge port (CP) is missing (MIA).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2180),
  ('BMS_a094_SW_Drive_Inverter_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has not received one or more expected CAN messages from the DI.', 'The BMS receives the expected messages from the DI CAN.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) does not receive one or more expected controller area network (CAN) messages from the drive inverter (DI) and has reported it as missing (MIA).', 'Power is reduced.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2181),
  ('BMS_a098_SW_BMB_Data_Integrity_Loss', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects a prolonged communication issue with the BMB daisy chain that is known to cause a loss of BMB sensor data.', 'No BMB sensor data loss conditions are detected for a prolonged period of time.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has lost data integrity due to a battery monitoring board (BMB) chain double break.', 'The BMS is likely performing BMB sensor data substitution to replace data missing due to the communication issue.', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2182),
  ('BMS_a099_SW_BMB_Communication', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A communication issue with the BMB daisy chain is detected.', 'No communication issues with the BMB daisy chain have been detected.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) cannot communicate with all of the battery monitoring boards (BMBs).', 'This alert is primarily informational, and may indicate a loss of BMB sensor data', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2183),
  ('BMS_a100_ThermalEventSuspected', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Any detection mechanism (e.g. VoltageLoss, VoltageDeviation) has set and is enabled to signal a suspected thermal event.', 'All detection mechanisms have cleared', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects conditions that indicate a potential propagating thermal event.', 'Pack may remain inoperable and should be serviced according to proper procedures.', 'Shutdown - Pull over and exit vehicle safely', 'Immediate service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2184),
  ('BMS_a105_SW_One_Module_Tsense', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) detects that any of the thermistors on a module is reporting an out-of-bounds temperature.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that a thermistor on a module is shorted or railed.', 'The vehicle operates normally with only one thermistor on the module.', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2185),
  ('BMS_a106_SW_All_Module_Tsense', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) detects that both thermistors on a module are reporting out-of-bounds temperatures.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) cannot measure the temperature on any module.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2186),
  ('BMS_a107_SW_Stack_Voltage_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects it cannot measure one or more stack voltages.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) cannot measure one or more stack voltages.', 'Inability to charge.', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2187),
  ('BMS_a109_HW_BMB_Mute_Status_Mismatch', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Mute is disabled for any device while balancing, or otherwise enabled for any device.', 'Mute is enabled for all devices while balancing, or otherwise disabled for all devices.', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) device has a mute status that does not align with the mute or unmute command sent by the Battery Management System (BMS).', 'Bleeding bricks that do not mute during balancing can impact the state of charge (SOC) estimation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2188),
  ('BMS_a120_SW_Delta_SOC_User_Warning', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'BMS_a118_SW_Delta_SOC_Weak_Short_Warning is set and (UI_dSocAlertEnable==1 or dSocAlertEnabledByDefault==1).', 'BMS_a118_SW_Delta_SOC_Weak_Short_Warning is cleared or (UI_dSocAlertEnable==0 and dSocAlertEnabledByDefault!=1).', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects a condition internal to the high voltage (HV) battery that requires notifying the customer of potential future impact.', 'This alert is informational and used for early customer notification. No impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2189),
  ('BMS_a122_SW_BMS_Therm_Irrational', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A thermistor reports a temperature that the BMS considers irrational.', 'All thermistors report rational temperatures.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects an irrational thermistor.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2190),
  ('BMS_a123_SW_Internal_Isolation', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that isolation dropped below the minimum threshold when pack contactors were open.', 'The BMS detects that isolation is above the minimum threshold when pack contactors are open.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that there is low high voltage isolation when pack contactors are opened.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2191),
  ('BMS_a124_Battery_Coolant_Flood', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that isolation dropped below the minimum threshold when pack contactors are open and the low coolant signal is active.', 'The BMS detects that isolation is above the minimum threshold when pack contactors are open and the low coolant signal is not active.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that there is a coolant flood in the high voltage battery.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2192),
  ('BMS_a127_SW_shunt_SNA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS does not receive consecutive current readings from the high voltage processor (HVP).', 'The BMS receives all of the expected messages from the HVP.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected that the shunt is unavailable (SNA).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2193),
  ('BMS_a128_SW_shunt_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS does not receive one or more expected CAN messages from the shunt.', 'The BMS receives all expected CAN messages from the shunt.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the shunt is missing (MIA).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2194),
  ('BMS_a129_SW_VSH_Failure', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects a VSH impedance value above the threshold.', 'All bricks report VSH impedance values within the threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected a high voltage sense harness (VSH) impedance.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2195),
  ('BMS_a131_Bleed_FET_Failure', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Upon a periodic wake, after an ECU reset, or every 6 hours, the Battery Management System (BMS) will test all bleed switches by switching them on in turn. If the sensed brick voltage does not significantly change, this alert is set.', 'The bleed test reports sufficient voltage change across each brick.', 'A bleed Field-Effect Transistor (FET) on the Battery Management Board (BMB) is not operating as designed. This will prevent the battery from balancing the brick by decreasing the brick voltage.', 'The bleed FET will prevent the battery from properly balancing the brick by bleeding the voltage down. There is a decrease in available energy to the vehicle potentially leading to decreased range.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2196),
  ('BMS_a132_HW_BMB_OTP_Uncorrctbl', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Any BMB device reports an uncorrectable error in the OTP memory.', 'All BMB devices report valid or correctable OTP memory.', 'An uncorrectable error has been detected in the OTP (one-time programmable) memory for a battery monitoring board (BMB) device.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. BMB device behavior may be impacted.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2197),
  ('BMS_a135_HW_BMB_Diagnostics_Failure', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS runs the BMB pattern diagnostics and detects a deviation from the expected results for any device in the chain.', 'The BMS runs the BMB pattern diagnostics and receives the expected results for all devices in the chain.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a pattern test failure on a battery monitoring board (BMB). .', 'This alert is primarily informational, and may indicate a potential BMB hardware failure.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2198),
  ('BMS_a136_SW_Module_OT_Warning', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The maximum module temperature is greater than the warning threshold.', 'The maximum module temperature is less than the temperature warning threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected one or more module temperatures exceed the warning threshold.', 'Vehicle performance is limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2199),
  ('BMS_a139_SW_DC_Link_V_Irrational', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected a mismatch between the pack voltage and DC Link voltage.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected a mismatch between the pack voltage and DC Link voltage.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2200),
  ('BMS_a140_HW_BMB_Status_Fault', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Any BMB device in the daisy chain reports any of the monitored fault indicators.', 'No BMB devices in the daisy chain report any of the monitored fault indicators.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detected a condition that indicates a BMB device fault.', 'This alert is primarily informational, and may indicate a potential BMB hardware failure that results in unreliable measurement data.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2201),
  ('BMS_a142_SW_Isolation_Degradation', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the HV isolation was below the warning threshold when pack contactors closed.', 'The BMS detects that HV isolation is above the warning threshold when pack contactors closed.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the high voltage (HV) isolation contactor closed below the warning threshold.', 'This alert indicates that HV isolation is low, but above the sufficient level for vehicle operation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2202),
  ('BMS_a143_SW_CAC_Change', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects a change in CAC above the limit threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a large calculated amp-hour capacity (CAC) update.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2203),
  ('BMS_a144_Hvp_Config_Mismatch', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects an HVP configuration that does not match the expected configuration.', 'The BMS has detects an HVP configuration that does match the expected configuration.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that the high voltage processor (HVP) configuration doesn''t match.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2204),
  ('BMS_a145_SW_SOC_Change', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) updated the high voltage (HV) battery State of Charge (SOC) by more than 3% based on SocByOcv (State of Charge by Open Circuit Voltage) while the vehicle rested (was not used).', 'This alert is primarily for logging purposes and should clear automatically.', 'A State of Charge (SOC) based on Open Circuit Voltage (OCV), known as SocByOcv, correction of greater than 3% to high voltage (HV) battery SOC occurred during the previous resting period (time vehicle was not used). This may cause a significant change in displayed range.', 'Significant change in displayed range (range variation) while the vehicle was not used.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2205),
  ('BMS_a146_SW_Brick_Overdischarged', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that a brick voltage measured below the minimal threshold.', 'The BMS detects that a brick voltage measured above the minimal threshold.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected that a brick is over-discharged.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2206),
  ('BMS_a148_SW_Unsupported_BMB_ASIC_Type', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS calibration block is configurated for a BMB ASIC type that is not supported.', 'The BMS calibration block is configurated for a supported BMB ASIC type.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a battery monitoring board (BMB) application-specific integrated circuit (ASIC) configuration that is not supported.', 'The BMS may be unable to obtain battery pack measurements.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2207),
  ('BMS_a149_SW_Missing_Config_Block', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the config block is missing.', 'The BMS detects the correct config block.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a missing, incorrect, or unsupported config block.', 'The BMS is unable to initialize configuration parameters.', 'Vehicle configuration mismatch', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2208),
  ('BMS_a150_SW_Missing_Part_Number', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects an unexpected part number.', 'The BMS detects the expected part number.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a missing, incorrect, or unsupported part number.', 'The BMS is unable to initialize parameters related to printed circuit board assembly (PCBA) configuration.', 'Vehicle configuration mismatch', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2209),
  ('BMS_a151_SW_external_isolation', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS has detects that HV isolation is below the warning threshold while contactors are closed.', 'The BMS has detects that HV isolation is within the acceptable threshold while contactors are closed.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects that high voltage (HV) isolation is too low while pack contactors are closed.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2210),
  ('BMS_a152_Isolation_In_Dc_Charge', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that isolation resistance on the high voltage (HV) bus has fallen below the acceptable threshold while the vehicle is DC charging', 'The BMS detects that isolation while contactors are closed is above the minimum acceptable threshold', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects low isolation while DC charging.', 'The vehicle will not charge until the charge cable is removed and the alert is cleared', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2211),
  ('BMS_a154_SW_Brick_OV_Warning_Stop_Charge', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that a brick exceeded the warning brick voltage for a sustained period of time while charging.', 'The BMS detects that all bricks are reporting acceptable brick voltages.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected that a brick has exceeded the warning brick voltage for a sustained period of time.', 'Vehicle charging is unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2212),
  ('BMS_a156_SW_BMB_Vref_bad', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Any battery monitoring board (BMB) reference voltage has continuously deviated outside the in-bounds threshold of the nominal voltage.', 'All BMB reference voltages continuously remain within the in-bounds threshold of the nominal voltage.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects an out-of-bounds module voltage reference.', 'This alert is primarily informational. Other BMB voltage signals will be substituted given the reference voltage is unreliable.', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2213),
  ('BMS_a158_SW_HVP_HVI_Comms', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS is not receiving the expected messages from the HV system.', 'The BMS is receiving all expected messages from the HV system.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) reports a communication issue with the high voltage processor (HVP).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2214),
  ('BMS_a159_SW_HVP_ECU_Error', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', ' Analog input pin from the HVP is raised pointing to the HVP Error line being asserted.', ' Analog input pin from the HVP has dropped.', 'The High Voltage Processor (HVP) error pin is asserted on Battery Management System (BMS) input.', 'There is a temporary loss of High Voltage (HV) functions.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2215),
  ('BMS_a162_SW_No_Power_For_Support', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects that the high voltage (HV) state of charge (SOC) is too low to support the LV system.', 'The BMS detects that the HV SOC is high enough to support the LV system.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) does not have enough power to provide Low Voltage (LV) support.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to drive', 'Battery charge level too low', 'customer;service-fix', 2216),
  ('BMS_a164_SW_Uncontrolled_Regen', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects regen power above the maximum threshold while in drive.', 'The BMS detects regen power within the threshold while in drive.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects an uncontrolled regen event.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to drive', 'PULL OVER SAFELY', 'customer;service-fix', 2217),
