  ('BMS_a175_Charge_Failure_External', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The BMS detects an issue during charging likely caused by the EVSE / external charging equipment', 'The charge cable is disconnected', 'Battery management system (BMS) detects a condition while charging likely caused by the EVSE / external charging equipment. The BMS stops charging and prevents retries while the charging equipment is connected.', 'The vehicle will not charge while this alert is set', 'Error detected while charging at this station', 'Try different charging station or location', 'customer;service', 2227),
