  ('BMS_f097_HW_BMB_Under_Voltage', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A brick voltage drops below the minimum allowed brick voltage threshold.', 'All brick voltages are above the minimum allowed brick voltage threshold.', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) reports a brick under voltage event, indicating that the BMB has detected a brick voltage lower than the minimum allowed brick voltage threshold.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'PULL OVER SAFELY', 'customer;service-fix', 2352),
