  ('BMS_f105_SW_One_Module_Tsense', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) detects that any of the thermistors on a module is reporting an out-of-bounds temperature.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that a thermistor on a module is shorted or railed.', 'The vehicle operates normally with only one thermistor on the module.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2359),
  ('BMS_f106_SW_All_Module_Tsense', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) detects that both of the thermistors on a module are reporting out-of-bounds temperatures.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'A battery monitoring board (BMB) detects that both of the thermistors on a module are reporting out-of-bounds temperatures.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2360),
  ('BMS_f107_SW_Cell_Voltage_Sensor', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A brick reports an inaccurate voltage measurement to the BMS. Alert log signal data provides information on the specific inconsistency.', 'All bricks report nominal voltage measurement readings.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects a brick voltage measurement that is inaccurate.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2361),
