  ('BMS_f110_SW_Module_Vsense', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the pack voltage does not match the sum of module voltages.', 'The BMS detects that the pack voltage matches the sum of module voltages.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that the pack voltage does not match the sum of module voltages.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service now', 'customer;service-fix', 2363),
  ('BMS_f114_SW_FC_Contactors', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The FC contactors are welded or the reported charge port state does not meet the expected state.', 'The FC contactors are not welded and the charge port state meets the expected states to charge.', 'The Fast Charge (FC) contactors are not ready for precharge.', 'The vehicle is temporarily unable to charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2364),
  ('BMS_f123_SW_Internal_Isolation', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that isolation dropped below the minimum threshold when pack contactors were open.', 'The BMS detects that isolation is above the minimum threshold when pack contactors are open.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that there is low high voltage isolation when pack contactors are opened.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service now', 'customer;service-fix', 2365),
  ('BMS_f124_SW_BMB_Comm_Integrity', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'One or more of the BMBs reports a communication issue to the BMS.', 'There are no BMBs reporting a communication issue to the BMS.', 'The vehicle detects a communication issue between the Battery Management System (BMS) and one or more of the Battery Monitor Boards (BMBs).', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. No expected impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2366),
  ('BMS_f126_HW_BMS_Blind_Mate', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The CPLD of the HV BMS detects a blind mate fault bit. The HVIL is on and HVIL voltage is greater than the blind mate alert threshold. The CPLD and the BMS concurrently detect the HVIL loop through the HV connector on the battery may not be connected.', 'The alert clears when the blind mate is cleared in the CPLD.', 'The Complex Programmable Logic Device (CPLD) of the High Voltage (HV) Battery Management System (BMS) detects a blind mate fault bit.', 'The HV connector on the battery pack is not connected to the HVIL loop. HVIL behavior may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2367),
  ('BMS_f129_SW_BMB_VSH_Connector', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the impedance of the VSH connector is above the limit threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the impedance of the VSH connector is below the limit threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected an issue with the voltage sensor harness (VSH) connector on the battery monitoring board (BMB).', 'The vehicle operates normally. This alert indicates that there may be an issue, and if impedance becomes too high the vehicle will not charge or drive (VOR).', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2368),
  ('BMS_f132_HW_BMB_OTP_Uncorrctbl', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A BMB TI536 ASIC chip has set the ECC_ERR bit in the ALERT_STATUS register.', 'The BMBs have been reset and the ECC_ERR bit in all ALERT_STATUS registers is clear.', 'An uncorrectable error has been detected in the OTP-EPROM register bank for a battery monitoring board (BMB).', 'OTP register(s) are not valid. The BMS will attempt to reset all of the TI536 ASICs and reenumerate them.', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2369),
  ('BMS_f133_SW_Service_Tool', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A software tool improperly requests an action from the BMS or requests an action that is not permitted.', 'None. This alert clears immediately after it is set.', 'A software tool (such as Toolbox) connected to the vehicle requests an action from the battery management system (BMS) that is either improperly requested or is not permitted in the current BMS state.', 'The requested diagnostic function is not performed.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2370),
  ('BMS_f136_SW_Module_OT_Warning', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A thermistor reports a module temperature above the acceptable range.', 'All thermistors report module temperatures within the acceptable range.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that a module is overheating.', 'Power is reduced.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2371),
  ('BMS_f137_SW_Brick_UV_Warning', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the minimum brick voltage is below the 0% SOC OCV target while fully rested and with the contactors open.', 'The BMS detects that the minimum brick voltage is above the 0% state of charge (SOC) open circuit voltage (OCV) target with open contactors and fully rested.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that there is an over-discharged brick.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2372),
  ('BMS_f138_SW_Brick_OV_Warning', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that one or more bricks'' voltage is above the warning threshold.', 'The BMS detects that all brick voltages are below the warning threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the voltage of one or more bricks is above the warning threshold.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2373),
  ('BMS_f139_SW_DC_Link_V_Irrational', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that there is an issue with the DC link voltage sensor.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected a that there is an issue with the DC link voltage sensor.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2374),
  ('BMS_f140_SW_OverCurrent_Sense', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects a HV battery current sensor (shunt) is unable to trip its over current fault line.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that there is a high voltage (HV) battery current sensor (shunt) error.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2375),
  ('BMS_f141_SW_12V_Pwr_Supply_Low', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the input voltage from the LV system is too low.', 'The BMS detects that the input voltage from the LV system is within nominal range.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected an issue with the low voltage (LV) power supply to the contactors.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Power reduced - Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2376),
  ('BMS_f142_SW_Isolation_Degradatio', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the HV isolation was below the warning threshold when pack contactors closed.', 'The BMS detects that HV isolation is above the warning threshold when pack contactors closed.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that the high voltage (HV) isolation contactor closed below the warning threshold.', 'This alert indicates that HV isolation is low, but above the sufficient level for vehicle operation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2377),
  ('BMS_f144_SW_CPLD_Version_Wrong', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the CPLD version is not supported by the current firmware FW.', 'The BMS detects that the CPLD version is supported by the current firmware FW.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the Complex Programmable Logic Device (CPLD) version is not supported by the current firmware (FW).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2378),
  ('BMS_f145_SW_socChange', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The SOC change is greater than specific threshold.', 'The alert clears as soon as it was set.', 'The vehicle''s State of Charge (SOC) changed when the pack is resting from open-circuit voltage (OCV) calibration.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. No expected impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2379),
  ('BMS_f146_SW_Brick_Overdischarged', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that a brick voltage measured below the minimal threshold.', 'The BMS detects that a brick voltage measured above the minimal threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that a brick is over-discharged.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2380),
  ('BMS_f149_SW_precharge_too_short', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detected that the voltage on the DC link bus rose faster than expected.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the length of time it took the vehicle to precharge was too short.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to start vehicle', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2381),
  ('BMS_f150_SW_precharge_too_long', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the voltage on the DC link bus is rising slower than it should be. Alert log signal data provides information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that it is taking too long to reach the target precharge voltage and prevents packs contactors from closing. This indicates that the voltage on the DC link bus rose more slowly than expected.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2382),
  ('BMS_f151_SW_external_isolation', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that HV isolation is below the warning threshold while contactors are closed.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that high voltage (HV) isolation is too low while pack contactors are closed.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Unable to start vehicle', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2383),
  ('BMS_f152_SW_pos_contactor_welded', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the positive contactor is stuck or welded.', 'This alert must be manually cleared.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the positive contactor is stuck or welded.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2384),
  ('BMS_f153_SW_neg_contactor_welded', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the negative contactor is stuck or welded.', 'This alert must be manually cleared.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the negative contactor is stuck or welded.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2385),
  ('BMS_f155_SW_BMB_Vref_leaky', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected that several samples from the ADC do not match, which indicates a reference problem.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected a potential battery monitoring board (BMB) hardware issue related to the analog-to-digital converter (ADC) voltage reference (VREF).', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2386),
  ('BMS_f156_SW_BMB_Vref_bad', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects a BMB voltage reference is unstable.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected a battery monitoring board (BMB) voltage reference is unstable.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2387),
  ('BMS_f158_SW_Low_Isolation_Wrn', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected that the HV isolation dropped below the minimum warning threshold multiple times in a short period.', 'The BMS detects that HV isolation is above the minimum warning threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects low high voltage (HV) isolation when pack contactors were closed.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. It is intended to flag low isolation issues before they are serious enough to prevent driving.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2388),
  ('BMS_f160_SW_Brick_Overcharged', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that a brick voltage is over the maximum threshold.', 'The BMS detects that all brick voltage measurements are within the acceptable range.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that a brick is over-charged.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. It is intended to flag early overvoltage issues.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2389),
  ('BMS_f161_SW_Contactor_Stress', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the pack contactor stress estimate is above the warning limit threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the pack contactor stress estimate is below the warning limit threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that pack contactor degradation has exceeded the maximum threshold.', 'This alert is primarily informational and serves as an early warning of pack contactor degradation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2390),
  ('BMS_f162_SW_FC_Prechg_Too_Slow', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the voltage on the DC link bus is rising slower than it should be.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that precharge was too slow to allow fast charge (FC).', 'The vehicle cannot DC FC.', 'Unable to DC Fast Charge / Supercharge', 'Disconnect and retry', 'customer;service-fix', 2391),
  ('BMS_f163_SW_Contactor_WOT_Count', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that contactors have undergone stress from a WOT event.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that contactors have undergone stress from a wide-open throttle (WOT) event.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Service is required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2392),
  ('BMS_f164_SW_Brick_SOC_Imbalance', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the SOC imbalance between any two bricks associated with a module is above the warning threshold.', 'All modules report no SOC discrepancies.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects a state of charge (SOC) imbalance between bricks associated with the same module.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2393),
  ('BMS_f165_SW_Module_SOC_Imbalance', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects an SOC delta that is outside of the expected threshold between the minimum brick SOC and the average brick SOC of the pack, and the alert BMS_a164_Brick_SOC_Imbalance is not active.', 'The BMS detects an SOC delta that is within the expected threshold between the minimum brick SOC and the average brick SOC of the pack.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects a state of charge (SOC) imbalance between modules.', 'No expected impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2394),
  ('BMS_f166_SW_AhToBeCharged_Imbal', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected that the difference between the brick that needs the least amp hours (Ah) compared to the one that needs the most is above the maximum threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the difference between the brick that needs the least amp hours (Ah) compared to the one that needs the most is within the acceptable range.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects a high delta between the brick that needs the least amp hours (Ah) compared to the one that needs the most Ah.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. It may indicate a poorly balanced pack, which should go away after the pack is properly balanced.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2395),
  ('BMS_f168_SW_Uncontrolled_Regen', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects regen power is above the maximum threshold while in drive.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected an uncontrolled regen event.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the low voltage (LV) system', 'Service is required', 'PULL OVER SAFELY', 'customer;service-fix', 2396),
  ('BMS_f169_SW_ModuleBrick_Mismatch', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects there is a mismatch between the sum of bricks of one module and the module voltage.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'he battery management system (BMS) has detected there is a mismatch between the sum of bricks of one module and the module voltage.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. It may indicate an issue with voltage sensing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2397),
  ('BMS_f170_SW_Module_Overvoltage', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'A module voltage sensor reports a voltage above the maximum threshold.', 'All module voltage sensors report voltage within the acceptable range.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that a module voltage sensor indicates voltage is too high.', 'Inability to charge', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2398),
  ('BMS_f171_SW_Pack_Motor_Mismatch', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects the GTW_frontDriveUnitType does not match the HV battery''s expectations.', 'The GTW_frontDriveUnitType matches the HV battery''s expectations.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects the GTW_frontDriveUnitType does not match the high voltage (HV) battery''s expectations.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes. It is usually triggered after an HV battery replacement.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2399),
  ('BMS_f172_SW_Drive_Iso_Warning', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that isolation is below the acceptable threshold over the course of multiple drive cycles.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected low isolation conditions during multiple drive cycles.', 'This alert is primarily informational.', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2400),
  ('BMS_f173_SW_Brick6_Sense', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected BMB brick 6 voltage sense inconsistencies.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected battery monitor board (BMB) brick 6 voltage sense inconsistencies.', 'Slight reduction of range at full charge', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2401),
  ('BMS_f174_StandbySupplyOutputLow', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'With the standby supply enabled, the output voltage measured by the Battery Management System (BMS) is less than the vehicle''s 12V input measurement for a significant amount of time.', 'With the standby supply enabled, the output voltage measured by the BMS is in the normal range or the pack contactors are not open (i.e. precharging, closed, or opening).', 'The standby supply output voltage is less than expected. The standby supply is unavailable.', 'The standby supply is unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 2402),
  ('BMS_f176_ReplaceSmartFuseNow', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'BMS detects that the HV battery pyro fuse is less than 1 months from end of life.', 'Pyro fuse is replaced with a self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected the HV battery pyro fuse is less than 1 months from end of life. The fuse must be replaced with a new self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'Pyro fuse is no longer functional', 'Battery fuse replacement required', 'OK to drive - Schedule service immediately', 'customer;service-fix', 2403),
  ('BMS_f177_OpenVshDetected', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'There is voltage growth in the opposite direction among two bricks.', 'The CLEAR_LATCH_BITS UDS StartRoutine is invoked.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) detects an open circuit on the Voltage Sense Harness (VSH).', 'Vehicle is unable to drive.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 2404),
  ('BMS_f178_OvUvRegWrong', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'COV or CUV disable bit is asserted for more than 10 consecutive seconds.', 'Disable bit in COV and CUV registers are de-asserted', 'Detect if the contents of the COV or CUV registers are wrong.', 'Failure to detect HW overvoltage / undervoltage scenarios', 'Unable to charge', 'Service is required', 'service-fix', 2405),
  ('BMS_f179_ReplaceSmartFuseLimp', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'BMS detects that the HV battery pyro fuse is 3 months past its recommended end of life.', 'Pyro fuse is replaced with a self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected the High Voltage (HV) battery pyro fuse is close to expiration. The fuse must be replaced with a new self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'Vehicle drive power will be reduced.', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 2406),
  ('BMS_f180_ReplaceSmartFuseBlockHv', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'BMS detects that the HV battery pyro fuse is 15 months past its recommended end of life.', 'Pyro fuse is replaced with a self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected the High Voltage (HV) battery pyro fuse is close to expiration or expired. The fuse must be replaced with a new self-powered hybrid pyro fuse.', 'The pack contactors are blocked from closing and the vehicle is unable to drive.', 'Battery fuse replacement required', 'Schedule service immediately', 'customer;service-fix', 2407),
  ('BMS_u001_DisChg_While_Charging', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the power source is too weak, or the battery is heating or cooling.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the high voltage (HV) battery is not charging.', 'Battery charge level may not increase.', 'Insufficient wall charging power source', 'Battery charge level will not increase', 'customer', 2408),
  ('BMS_u002_Ramp_Down_Active', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects a condition that requires the HV battery to enter ramp down.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has put the high voltage (HV) battery into ramp down.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support low voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle shutting down', 'PULL OVER SAFELY', 'customer', 2409),
  ('BMS_u003_Insufficient_drive_pwr', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the HV battery state of charge (SOC) is below the threshold required to drive.', 'The BMS detects that the HV battery state of charge (SOC) is above the threshold required to drive.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that there is not enough power from the high voltage (HV) battery to drive.', 'Inability to drive', 'Unable to drive', 'Battery charge level too low', 'customer', 2410),
  ('BMS_u004_Charge_Cable_Connected', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the vehicle attempted to shift into drive while a charge cable is inserted.', 'The BMS detects that the cable is no longer inserted.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that a charge cable is inserted when the vehicle attempts to shift into Drive.', 'Inability to drive', 'Unable to drive', 'Close charge port door', 'customer', 2411),
  ('BMS_u005_Low_Power_Until_Charge', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the high voltage (HV) battery state of charge (SOC) is too low.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has reduced output power until the vehicle charges.', 'Output power may be reduced.', 'Acceleration reduced', 'Battery charge level too low', 'customer', 2412),
  ('BMS_u006_End_of_Drive_Ramp_Down', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected the SOC has crossed below the minimum threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has put the high voltage (HV) battery into an end-of-drive ramp down due to a low state of charge (SOC).', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support low voltage (LV) system', 'Vehicle shutting down - PULL OVER SAFELY', 'Battery charge level too low', 'customer', 2413),
  ('BMS_u007_Slowed_Chg_Batt_Cold', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects charging is active and the cell temperature is below the minimum threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has limited the rate of charging until cell temperatures increase.', 'The HV battery charge rate is limited by cold cell temperature, and input charge power is applied to heating the pack.', 'Battery is heating - Keep charge cable inserted', 'Charge rate will increase once battery is warm', 'customer', 2414),
  ('BMS_u008_limpMode', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS has detected a condition that would damage the HV system if the vehicle continues to drive.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects a condition that would damage the high voltage (HV) system, so it puts the vehicle in limp mode.', 'Acceleration and top speed are reduced, and regenerative breaking is reduced.', 'Acceleration and top speed reduced', 'Performance may be restored on next drive', 'customer;service-fix', 2415),
  ('BMS_u011_Fast_Charger_Problem', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects a condition that prevents fast charging.', 'The BMS detects that the condition clears.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected an issue that prevents DC fast charging.', 'Inability to DC fast charge', 'Unable to DC Fast Charge / Supercharge', 'Disconnect and retry', 'customer', 2416),
  ('BMS_u012_Fast_Charger_Incompat', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the vehicle FW is not compatible with the fast charger.', 'The BMS detects that the FW is compatible with the fast charger.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has detected that the fast charger is not compatible with the firmware (FW) version installed on the vehicle.', 'Inability to DC fast charge', 'Unable to charge', 'Software update required', 'customer', 2417),
  ('BMS_u013_Not_Supercharge_Capable', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The battery management system (BMS) detects that the vehicle is not configured for Supercharging.', 'The BMS detects that the vehicle is configured for Supercharging.', 'The vehicle attempts to Supercharge when it is not allowed / configured to do so.', 'Inability to Supercharge', 'Supercharging not enabled', 'Try AC charging', 'customer', 2418),
