  ('BMS_u018_SOC_Imbalance_Limiting', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the overall SOC imbalance (BMS_socCellMaxDbg - BMS_socCellMinDbg) exceeds the acceptable threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the overall SOC imbalance (BMS_socCellMaxDbg - BMS_socCellMinDbg) is within the threshold.', 'The battery managed system (BMS) detects a condition internal to the high voltage (HV) battery that requires it to limit the maximum allowed brick voltage.', 'The target max brick voltage for charge is limited to the voltage corresponding to 50% state of charge (SOC).', 'Maximum battery charge level reduced', 'OK to drive - Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 2423),
  ('BMS_u019_Acceleration_Reduced', 'Model S 2012-2020;Model X 2015-2020', 'The BMS detects that the contactor stress estimate has exceeded the grace period threshold.', 'The BMS detects that the contactor stress estimate falls below the grace period threshold.', 'The battery management system (BMS) has limited the maximum discharge current.', 'The maximum discharge current will be linearly ramped down as contactor stress continues to increase.', 'Acceleration reduced', 'Performance may be restored on next drive', 'customer;service-fix', 2424),
