  ('DIR_a024_selfTest', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The Switch Off Path Test (SOPT) for Drive Unit has failed. The DIx and PM torque measurements are different. The pathway between DIx and PM may have a condition affecting functionality.', 'This alert is primarily intended for logging purposes. If this alerts repeatedly asserts, there may a condition affecting the DIx hardware.', 'The Switch Off Path Test (SOPT) for Drive Unit has failed. The pathway between Drive Inverter (DIx) and Pedal Monitor (PM) torque measurements are different.', 'PM may not be able to shut down torque produced by Drive Unit.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 4155),
