  ('DIR_a055_trqCrossCheck', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The DIx and PM estimate different amounts of torque production, causing a Cross Check mismatch. There may be a condition affecting DIx''s or PM''s ability to measure torque.', 'The DIx and PM measure the same amount of torque production during a Cross Check.', 'The Drive Inverter (DIx) and Pedal Monitor (PM) estimate different amounts of torque production, causing a Cross Check mismatch.', 'The vehicle may not accurately measure the level of torque being produced by the Drive Unit.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 4183),
