  ('DPB_a075_rotorSinOutOfRangeHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The rotation position sensor is shorted to high. Raw analog-to-digital converter values are read to detect this condition.', 'ignition on wait 5 s', 'The rotation position sensor reports a higher Sin+ or Sin- value than expected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5249),
  ('DPB_a076_rotorSinOutOfRangeLow', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The rotation position sensor is shorted to ground. Raw analog-to-digital converter values are read to detect this condition.', 'ignition on wait 5 s', 'The rotation position sensor reports a lower Sin+ or Sin- value than expected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5250),
  ('DPB_a077_tempSens1ShortToSupply', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) BLM temperature sensor 1 is shorted to supply.', 'Monitoring runs continuously and is curable within operation cycle', 'The Brushless Motor (BLM) is shorted to supply voltage.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5251),
  ('DPB_a078_tempSens1ShortToGround', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) BLM temperature sensor 1 is shorted to ground.', 'Monitoring runs continuously and is curable within operation cycle', 'The Brushless Motor (BLM) is shorted to ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5252),
  ('DPB_a079_tempSens2ShortToSupply', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) BLM temperature sensor 2 is shorted to supply.', 'Monitoring runs continuously and is curable within operation cycle', 'The Brushless Motor (BLM) is shorted to supply voltage.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5253),
  ('DPB_a080_tempSens2ShortToGround', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) BLM temperature sensor 2 is shorted to ground.', 'Monitoring runs continuously and is curable within operation cycle', 'The Brushless Motor (BLM) is shorted to ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5254),
  ('DPB_a081_tempSensImplausVoltage', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The added voltages of the Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) BLM temperature sensors have no constant value.', 'Monitoring runs continuously and is curable within operation cycle', 'The Brushless Motor (BLM) temperature sensors report implausible values.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5255),
  ('DPB_a082_chargePumpFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Capacity of charge pump buffer or performance of charge pump is not sufficient.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The charge pump is not operating as expected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5256),
  ('DPB_a083_chargePumpUndervoltage', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The voltage at the charge pump is less than expected.', 'System continues to execute charge pump tests every 19s and will good check if execution is successful.', 'The charge pump is undervoltage.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5257),
  ('DPB_a084_RBCPUException', 'Model Y 2025+', 'In case of a CPU exception, an alert is reported and the system is degraded accordingly.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'CPU exception occurred.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5258),
  ('DPB_a085_infoFailureWrongCUBASHandlingDetected', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Alert is set when a stop protocol callback is called from stack and no protocol is active.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Diagnostic Application Callback Handler information alert for indication of wrong callback handling of stack.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5259),
  ('DPB_a086_diagHydProtectionPressFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'High pressure is created in the system due to eg: plunger movement in diagnostic mode. Alert is set in diagnostic mode, when high pressure is built up within Hydraulic Unit.', 'A successful test after 5 seconds of issue detection will heal the issue', 'High system pressure protection is enabled.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5260),
  ('DPB_a087_diagHydProtectionVlvFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The valve overheat protection is enabled. This can happen when the valves actuate for too long in diagnostic mode.', 'A successful test after 300 seconds when diagnostic actuation of valves and pump motor is switched off will heal the issue', 'Valve overheat protection is enabled.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5261),
  ('DPB_a088_DMATransferError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'DMA channel or module could not be suspended or aborted until timeout threshold, The monitoring is a continuous monitoring of DMA/DTS transfer errors due to timeouts.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Transfer error occurred during a Direct Memory Access (DMA) transfer.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5262),
  ('DPB_a089_ecuBandgap', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The bandgap voltage measured by the Analog-to-Digital Converter (ADC) is not within specification. This can be due to an issue affecting the ADC.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) ECU reports a condition affecting its bandgap.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5263),
  ('DPB_a090_flashFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'A flash error like an incorrect checksum or single error overflow is detected.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The Decoupled Power Brake (DPB) reports an issue during flashing.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5264),
  ('DPB_a091_MRGPathTestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'MRG is either always switched ON or Not able to Switch OFF when Hydraulic Enable or MRA control is pulled LOW.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The control over MRG via EN_HY or MRAUC or both does not work.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5265),
  ('DPB_a092_decoupleBitTestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'System chip internal decouple bits are not reset within the expected time. The failsafe logic test sets the hydraulic and electric decouple bits of the system chip.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Alert in system ASIC: Electric or hyraulic decouple bit not reset automatically.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5266),
  ('DPB_a093_ecuBistFaultCtrFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (BIST of system IC does not switch off electrically after too much received wrong BIST commands), The failsafe logic test tests that after 3 wrong BIST commands the BIST alert counter counted up to its max. value and that the BIST state machine switches off electrically consequently.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Built-In Self Test (BIST) didn''t switch off electrically after too much received wrong BIST commands.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5267),
  ('DPB_a094_ecuClockTestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (The clockin monitor of the system IC reports wrong clockin alert status to the uC). This alert is logged if the feedback to the uC does not show the expected clockin alert state.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Clockin monitor of system IC reports wrong clockin alert status to uC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5268),
  ('DPB_a095_ecuEnableElHighFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'ECU internal electrical enable line has either a short to GND or cannot be switched on by the micro controller and the system chip. Initial test of the ECU internal electrical enable line detects that enable line cannot be switched on by the software.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The electric enable can''t be switched on via the uC port and via the system IC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5269),
  ('DPB_a096_ecuEnableElLowFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'ECU internal electrical enable line has either a short to 3.3V or cannot be switched off by the micro controller or the system chip. Initial test of the ECU internal electrical enable line detects that enable line cannot be switched off by the software.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The electric enable can''t be switched off via the uC port and via the system IC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5270),
  ('DPB_a097_ecuEnableHyHighFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'ECU internal hydraulical enable line has either a short to ground or cannot be switched on by the micro controller and the system chip. Initial test of the ECU internal hydraulic enable line detects that enable line cannot be switched on by the software.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The hydraulic enable line can''t be switched on via the uC and via the system IC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5271),
  ('DPB_a098_ecuEnableHyLowFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'ECU internal electrical enable line has either a short to 3.3V or cannot be switched off by the micro controller or the system chip. Initial test of the ECU internal hydraulic enable line detects that enable line cannot be switched off by the software.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The hydraulic enable line can''t be switched off via the uC or via the system IC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5272),
  ('DPB_a099_ecuEnContinuousError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Interruption or short to GND of a monitored ECU internal enable line. After the failsafe logic test has finished the ECU internal enable lines are monitored. It is expected that the enable lines always stay at high level (except the SW intends another state). If this is not the case this fault is logged.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Continuous monitor of enable lines detected a missing(low) enable signal.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5273),
  ('DPB_a100_ecuErrpinCounterFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Error pin event counter within system chip does not increment on error pin event. The failsafe logic test pulls the error pin to test the error pin event counter within the system chip.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Alert in system ASIC: Errorpin event not counted.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5274),
  ('DPB_a101_ecuFastWdTestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (e.g. BIST of system IC either does not detect a correct BIST command or missing BIST commands), The failsafe logic test tests whether the watchdog of the system chip can be started with the first watchdog trigger signal from the BIST state machine. Additionally it is tested that the watchdog switches off hydraulically respective electrically if the BIST state machine is not triggered during the corresponding timeout times.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Missing Built-In Self Test (BIST) trigger didn''t swicth off hydraulically or electrically as expected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5275),
  ('DPB_a102_ecuVrOnWhileWdTimeout', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (Watchdog timeout detection of system chip erroneous). The failsafe logic test tests whether the system chip detects a missing watchdog trigger and therefore swichtes off the gate actuation of the valve relay. If the feedback does not show a switched off valve relay gate this fault is set.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The missing watchdog don''t switch off the valve relay.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5276),
  ('DPB_a103_ecuVrViaSpiFails', 'Model Y 2025+', 'System chip does not switch off the valve relay gate actuation via SPI or the feedback bit does report a wrong status, The failsafe logic test tests whether the system chip can switch off the gate actuation of the valve relay via SPI command. If the feedback does not show a switched off valve relay gate this fault is set.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'The valve relay cannot be switched off via the SPI command of the system IC.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5277),
  ('DPB_a104_ecuWdStartuptestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic within system chip or feedback of system chip is wrong. During failsafe logic test the watchdog status feedback from the system chip is tested against several patterns according to the ongoing sub test. If the watchdog status is not as expected this fault is logged.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'During failsafe logic test actual and expected WD status of System IC differ.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5278),
  ('DPB_a105_ecuWdSContinuousError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (e.g. watchdog trigger is not detected by system chip, unintended setting of alert flip-flop within system chip). After the failsafe logic test has finished the status of the watchdog or rather the safety logic is being continuously monitored. If the status is not as expected this fault is logged.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Watchdog status of system IC deviates from the expected one.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5279),
  ('DPB_a106_ecuBistCmdTestFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (the BIST state machine of the system chip could be activated by a wrong BIST command value), The failsafe logic test tests whether the BIST state machine does detect and suppress a wrong BIST command value. This alert is logged if the watchdog of the system chip is triggered by the wrong BIST command value.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Contrary to spec Built-In Self Test (BIST) state machine of system IC is started by a wrong BIST command.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5280),
  ('DPB_a107_vrOnFails', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Erroneous safety logic (Valve relay gate does not switch on or feedback of system chip is wrong), The failsafe logic test switches on the valve relay and checks whether the gate actuation (system chip internally) is possible, If not, this fault is set.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'A switched on valve relay is reported as off (system chip internal status).', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5281),
  ('DPB_a108_GTMRefFrequencyError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'GTM peripheral of micro controller is not right or reference clock from system ASIC (D_REF) is faulty or there is any fault in signal path from ASIC to micro controller. A 4kHz reference frequency signal from system ASIC is cyclically checked via GTM to be in correct range.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'GTM reference frequency error.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5282),
  ('DPB_a109_GTMTbuMonError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Clock signal to GTM peripheral or system timer is faulty. The time passed in the sytem timer is compared with the time passed in GTM peripheral.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'GTM reference frequency error.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5283),
  ('DPB_a110_HWBISTError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'alert detected in non-redundant safety measures (e.g. compare units) by LBIST or memory alert detected in Global RAM, Local RAM or Peripheral RAMs by MBIST (uncorrectable ECC fault or limit of ECC correctable bit faults exceeded).', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'HWBIST detected an error.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5284),
  ('DPB_a113_LiPS1SentLineHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor Channel 1 Line Short to Supply or Channel 1 Line open or Interruption of Sensor ground.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, line shorted to Supply or Channel 1 Line open or Interruption of Sensor ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5285),
  ('DPB_a114_LiPS1SentLineLow', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1 Line Short to ground.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, line shorted to ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5286),
  ('DPB_a115_LiPS1SentSensor', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, Sensor reports an error code.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, Sensor internal alert.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5287),
  ('DPB_a116_LiPS1SentTransmission', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, noise on SENT-line or SENT-sensor.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 1, alert in SENT protocol.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5288),
  ('DPB_a117_LiPS2PwmLineHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2 Line Short to Supply or Channel 2 Line open or Interruption of Sensor ground.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2, line shorted to Supply or Channel 2 Line open or Interruption of Sensor ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5289),
  ('DPB_a118_LiPS2PwmLineLow', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2 Line Short to ground.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2, line shorted to ground.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5290),
  ('DPB_a119_LiPS2PwmTransmission', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2, Duty or period is out of range.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Channel 2, Duty or period is out of range.', 'System will be running with internal degraded pedal map. Braking may require increased effort.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5291),
  ('DPB_a120_LiPSOutOfRangeHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, OBD Out of Range High.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Out of Range High.', 'System will request Hydraulic Boost Compensation when driver pressed the brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5292),
  ('DPB_a121_LiPSOutOfRangeLow', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Linear Position Sensor, OBD Out of Range Low.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Linear Position Sensor, Out of Range Low.', 'System will request Hydraulic Boost Compensation when driver pressed the brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5293),
  ('DPB_a122_micAsicClkInError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'System ASIC CLKIN input signal is outside of the specified frequency range, uC is monitoring SPI register bit CLKIN_fail_SPI every specified time and the alert is confirmed when this alert bit is set for longer than specified time.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'System ASIC CLKIN alert is detected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5294),
  ('DPB_a123_micAsicInitTestError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Defect in the System ASIC, the alert detection function in the ASIC doen''t work. uC sends some alert test frames (address error, parity error, clock error) and evaluate the responses. The tests pass if the ASIC could detect the alert and set corresponding alert flags.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'ASIC Init test failed during init task.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5295),
  ('DPB_a124_asicOscillatorError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'System ASIC internal oscillator doesn''t work correct (too low or too high frequency), uC is monitoring SPI register bit OSCfail_set_FF every specified time and the alert is confirmed when this alert bit is set for longer than 80ms.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'System ASIC internal oscillator alert is detected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5296),
  ('DPB_a125_B6AsicFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'B6AsicFault Internal bridge driver ASIC hardware defect detected.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Internal bridge driver ASIC hardware defect detected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5297),
  ('DPB_a126_MICB6TransferError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Transfer Error (error frame, wrong address. timeout, CSIH error) is logged if a SPI alert is detected by ASIC or uC.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'SPI transfer to Bridge Driver ASIC failed.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5298),
  ('DPB_a127_hydraulicAsicShortCircuit', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Short circuit between Qx pin and MRAuC pin, MRAuC is actuated (with Qx On) for a short time and check MRG state via MRG_on_SPI bit. If the bit is 0, the alert is logged.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Short circuit beteen Qx pin and MRAuC pin are detected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5299),
  ('DPB_a128_micSpiTransferError', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Transfer Error (error frame, wrong address. timeout, CSIH error) is logged if a SPI alert is detected by ASIC or uC.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'SPI transfer to System ASIC failed.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5300),
  ('DPB_a129_AsicTrimmingNotCompleted', 'Model Y 2025+', 'System ASIC trimming is not completed. The trimming of the ASIC is a step in the production of the System ASIC.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'System ASIC trimming is not completed.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5301),
  ('DPB_a130_AsicMalfunctionDetected', 'Model Y 2025+', 'This fault will be reported if the GPIO is switched off but the overcurrent bit of the ASIC remains set (GPIO is not operating as expected).', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'On the system ASIC an overcurrent event occured. The General Purpose Input Output (GPIO) is not operating as expected.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5302),
  ('DPB_a131_ASICOvercurrentOnGPIO250_1', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Overcurrent was detected. Overcurrent bit of ASIC is checked and the GPIO is switched off for certain seconds.', 'Wait for 20 seconds and leave GPIO switched on.', 'ASICOvercurrentOnGPIO250 On the system ASIC an overcurrent event occured on GPIO250_1.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5303),
