  ('DPB_a255_valveRelayShort', 'Model Y 2025+', '(1) Short between UVR GND, Continuous monitoring checks for short between VR and GND if VR is in off state.  (2) Short between UVR GND, Continuous monitoring checks for short between VR and GND if VR is in off state.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Short between UVR and GND.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5417),
  ('DPB_a256_valveRelayActuationFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'State of VRG Status via SPI does not fit to logical switch state, Check for palusibility between target switch state of the valve relay and its internal actuation state.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Feedback of VRG actuation ot plausible.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5418),
  ('DPB_a257_valveRelayOnContinuous', 'Model Y 2025+', '(1) UVR voltage does not fit to the target VR state, Comparing UVR and UBVR.  (2) VR does not switch off in hydraulic failsafe state, Comparing UVR and UBVR.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'VR can not be switched off.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5419),
  ('DPB_a258_valveRelayOffContinuous', 'Model Y 2025+', '(1) UVR voltage does not fit to the target VR state, Comparing UVR and UBVR.  (2) VR can not be switched on, Comparing UVR and UBVR.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'VR can not be switched on.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5420),
  ('DPB_a259_valveRelayTestUndervoltage', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Voltage conditions (valve supply) for initial valve relay safety test is not correct. Test if the VR can be switched off by safety logic.', 'PowerOn Wait7s', 'Conditions for valve relay switch on test not correct.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5421),
  ('DPB_a260_valveRelaySafetySwitchFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Redundant safety switch fails, Test if VR can be switched off by redundant safety switch.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Redundant safety switch fails.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5422),
  ('DPB_a261_WdhAsicWdCmdMissing', 'Model Y 2025+', 'One or more command numbers for safe backbone monitoring and tests are not scheduled by system ASIC. System ASIC defect. All 50 command numbers have to be scheduled by system ASIC during monitoring interval.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'At least one command number for safe backbone monitoring not scheduled from system asic watchdog.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5423),
  ('DPB_a262_WdhAsicWdErrorCntLimit', 'Model Y 2025+', 'WdhAsicWdErrorCntLimit Number of faulty watchdog trigger pattern too high.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Number of faulty watchdog trigger pattern too high.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5424),
  ('DPB_a263_WdhAsicWdErrorCntStuck', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Cyclic test of system ASIC watchdog fails.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Watchdog of system asic does not react on wrong trigger pattern.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5425),
  ('DPB_a264_WdhSwBistConCnt', 'Model Y 2025+', 'SW-BIST signatures of both cores are different. Signatures from SW-BIST routines will be calculated from Core 1 and Core 2 and compared if they are equal. Status of comparison is reported to watchdog handler by consumption counter interface.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Dual Core SW-Bist comparison fault.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5426),
  ('DPB_a265_WdhTaskMonConCnt', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Task monitor fault. Task scheme is monitored by task monitoring service. Status of monitoring is reported to watchdog handler by consumption counter interface.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Task Monitor reports faulty status.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5427),
  ('DPB_a266_RPSNvMReadFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Defect NVM or rotor position sensor calibration was not done successfully (new ECU).', 'trigger RPS Calibration', 'Reading of rotor position calibration data from NvM failed.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5428),
  ('DPB_a267_RpsAngleImplausible', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Implausible too high angle jump in RPS signal, alert is logged if an implausible high angle jump in the rotor position signal is detected while the actuator position is valid.', 'Ignition off; wait 5 seconds; Ignition on', 'The alert is logged whenver the absolute deviation between the unfiltered RPS speed and filtered speed exceeds 711.2 rad/s, provided the actuator position is valid.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5429),
  ('DPB_a268_RPSVectorOscillating', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Magnetic field distorted or electrical alert of rotor position sensor raw signals. Oscillations or jumps detected.', 'Ignition off; wait 5 seconds; Ignition on', 'rotor position sensor raw signals: vector length is oscillating.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5430),
  ('DPB_a269_RPSVectorRangeHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'electrical alert of rotor position sensor raw signals.', 'Ignition off; wait 5 seconds; Ignition on', 'rotor position sensor raw signals: vector length is too high.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5431),
  ('DPB_a270_RPSVectorRangeLow', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Magnetic field too weak or electrical alert of rotor position sensor raw signals.', 'Ignition off; wait 5 seconds; Ignition on', 'rotor position sensor raw signals: vector length is too low.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5432),
  ('DPB_a271_RPSWrongCalibData', 'Model Y 2025+', 'RPS calibration was done by SW which is incompatible with ECU SW. Maybe incompatible SW was flashed?, Check version of RPS calibration data in NvM for compatibility with ECU SW.', 'trigger RPS Calibration', 'Mismatch between RPS calibration data version in NvM and SW version.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5433),
  ('DPB_a272_runtimeAssertionFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'A runtime assertion was not fulfilled.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle. If the condition persists, the DPB module may require replacement.', 'Runtime Assertion Failed.', 'System will be running in fully degraded state. Braking may require increased effort. Hydraulic Boost Compensation will be triggered when driver pressed brake pedal.', 'Power braking assist reduced', 'Braking may require increased effort', 'customer;service-fix', 5434),
  ('DPB_a273_SMMOneRequestsInit', 'Model Y 2025+', 'If one requester is still in INIT for a long period of time than the configured detection time, DSM logges the alert, Info fault if one requester is still in init after the detection time is reached.', 'The issue will be healed, once the requester of the system mode manager (SMM) are no longer in INIT state', 'SMM info alert.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5435),
  ('DPB_a275_Ps1Ps2PlausibilityFault', 'Model Y 2025+', 'temperature sensor defect, alert is set if difference between both temperature sensors exceeds 15 K.', 'Goodcheck after 60s if difference between temperature sensors is <=12 K.', 'Plausibilization between temperature sensors.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5436),
  ('DPB_a280_LowBrakeFluid', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Brake fluid sensor shows fluid empty, This monitoring detects if brake fluid level is below functional range.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Brake fluid level low.', 'System will request Hydraulic Boost Compensation when driver pressed the brake pedal.', 'Brake fluid low', 'Pull over safely - Press brake pedal firmly to stop', 'customer;service-fix', 5437),
  ('DPB_a281_brakeFluidOORHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', '1.)Brake fluid sensor line is shorted to power supply. 2.)Open line detected at brake fluid sensor line. This monitoring is to detect if brake fluid sensor line is shorted to power supply.', 'Switch on ECU wait 5 seconds', 'Brake Fluid Level Out of Range High.', 'System will request Hydraulic Boost Compensation when driver pressed the brake pedal.', 'Brake fluid level sensor service required', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 5438),
