  ('DPB_a286_ebrCmdStateInvalid', 'Model Y 2025+', 'PM_ebrCmdState was set as Invalid.', 'No internal issue is detected after changing operation cycle.', 'The External Brake Request (EBR) command state reported by the Pedal Monitor (PM) is invalid.', 'System will be running with full assistant for driver brake request.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 5443),
