  ('EGGLEFTVC_a415_undervoltageSelfTestStuckOff', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more loads failed to turn on during the Left Domain Undervoltage Self-Test.', 'The Left Domain Undervoltage self-test is ran again and the load is turned on successfully.', 'One or more loads failed to turn on during the Left Domain Undervoltage Self-Test. Those loads will be inhibited from use in drive.', 'Impacted load(s) will not be usable in drive.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 6183),
