  ('EGGRIGHT3_a098_DIR_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DIR ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DIR ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear drive inverter (DIR) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the DIR ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 6376),
  ('EGGRIGHT3_a100_CANbus_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'If 50% or more of the ECUs the local ECUs listens to are MIA, and the local ECU receives from more than 3 ECUs on this bus. An ECU is MIA if more than 50% of its messages are MIA and that ECU is considered CAN active (see specific ECU''s MIA alert for CAN active conditions).', 'Less than 50% of the ECUs the local ECUs listens to are MIA, and the local ECU receives messages from more than 3 ECUs on this bus. An ECU is MIA if more than 50% of its messages are MIA and that ECU is considered CAN active (see specific ECU''s MIA alert for CAN active conditions).', 'More than half of the Electronic Control Units (ECUs) on either the Left CAN (LC) or Right CAN (RC) bus are missing more than half their messages while the bus should be active.', 'Vehicle functionality may not operate as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 6377),
