  ('EPAS3S_a160_latentFaultTestResult', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Electronic Power Assist Steering (EPAS) detected an issue in power electronics hardware', 'Electronic Power Assist Steering (EPAS) power cycle. Alert latches after setting', 'Secondary EPAS initialization self test failed.', 'Secondary EPAS initialization issue detected. Redundant power steering unavailable', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 6834),
