  ('EPBL_a076_BCRPM_MIA', 'Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCRPM is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCRPM.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear passenger door body controller (BCRPM) is not received, indicating the BCRPM may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The rear passenger side falcon door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 7461),
