  ('EPBL_a078_BCFALCP_MIA', 'Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'An expected CAN message from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the BCFALCP is CAN active. The BCFALCP is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the BCFALCP is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. The passenger side Falcon door may not function as expected.', 'The passenger side Falcon door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 7463),
