  ('EPBR_a097_CMP_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the CMP ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CMP ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the air conditioning compressor (CMP) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CMP ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The HVAC system may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 7608),
