  ('ESP_a018_WSSSignFrontAxle', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Front wheel speed sensors are on opposite wheels on the front axle', 'Fix WSS mounting alignment and power cycle', 'Wheel Speed Sensor swapped front axle.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7754),
  ('ESP_a019_WSSSignRearAxle', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One wheel speed sensor is mounted backwards on the rear axle', 'Fix WSS mounting alignment and power cycle', 'Wheel Speed Sensor swapped rear axle.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7755),
  ('ESP_a020_WSSGenericTempFault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Three or more sensor signals seem to be affected by temporary failure suspicion at the same time (one or several of the above described failure monitoring are triggered by not plausible or missing WSS signals).', 'Check WSS connections and power cycle.', 'Wheel Speed Sensor: General Fault.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS. Leads to deactivation of BSC and EBD.', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7756),
  ('ESP_a021_WSSGeneralVDiffFault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'If the difference between maximum and minimum wheel speed related to a reference speed exceeds 5%. A generic wheel speed sensor fault is set if no wheel specific fault could be determined. During system mode ABS and backup-EBD  (Electr. Brake Force Distribution) and below 20 kilometers per hour the deviation is 6 kilometers per hour for velocities < 100 kilometers per hour and 6% for a velocity > 100 kilometers per hour.', '1.) Open circuit in the WSS line  2.) Short circuit to + voltage in the WSS line  3.) Short circuit to GND in WSS line 4.) WSS dislodging from bracket  5.) Input amplifier in ECU faulty 6.) tooth wheel missing 7.) WSS not installed 8.) too great airgap 9.) incorrect tooth count', 'Wheel Speed Sensor: General Fault.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7757),
  ('ESP_a022_WSSDirectionFault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'This error will be set if 2 rotation directions of the sensor signal are in one direction, the other 2 rotations are in the other direction OR 2 rotation directions of the sensor signal have no rotation, 1 rotation in one direction, 1 rotation in other direction', 'Check proper mounting of all four WSS. Monitor clears when all wheel speed sensors show the same rotation for 20 seconds.', 'Wheel Speed Sensor: General Fault.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7758),
  ('ESP_a023_WSSSeveralSuspected', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'More than one suspected wheel speed sensor failures occur at the same time for more than 500ms. A suspected wheel speed sensor failure is set in the following situation: Noise monitoring- slip monitoring- dynamic monitoring- monitoring of absent signal or monitoring of flat tire sets a suspicious flag.', 'Check connection integrity and power cycle, replace WSS if necessary.', 'Wheel Speed Sensor: General Fault.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7759),
  ('ESP_a024_WSSReverseCurrent', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Backward power supply of ECU via WSS supply line is detected. One of the WSS power supply lines is shorted to Ubat.', 'Check WSS connection line for short circuits.', 'Reverse current at wheel speed sensor supply detected and the reverse protection switch is switched off.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7760),
  ('ESP_a025_FrLWSSOpenOrShortToGnd', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Short circuit of the sensor line to GND or line interruption (sensor- or supply line) .', 'Check WSS connection for short circuit and repair/replace harness or sensor', 'Short circuit of the WSS_FL sensor line to GND or line interruption (sensor or supply line).', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7761),
  ('ESP_a026_FrLWSSShortTo12V', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Short circuit of the wheel speed sensor line to + voltage.', 'Check WSS connection for short circuit and repair/replace harness or sensor', 'Short circuit of the WSS_FL sensor line to 12V.', 'Will disable VDC/TC and degrade ABS', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7762),
