  ('ESP_a283_secondaryCollisionMitigationActive', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The RCM reports an accident to the ESP ECU.', 'The vehicle comes to a complete stop or the driver overrides the ESP by using the accelerator pedal.', 'The Restraints Control Module (RCM) reports an accident and commands the Electronic Stability Program (ESP) electronic control unit (ECU) to actuate the brakes to prevent a secondary collision.', 'The ESP ECU may engage the brakes.', 'Collision detected', 'Brakes applied and acceleration disabled', 'customer;service', 7904),
