  ('ESP_a349_ForceLampToRed', 'Model Y 2025+', 'TargetStateHBB or TargetStateABS do not report ON for more than 10 hours OR both the DPB and ESP are not operating as expected.', 'HBB and ABS TargetStates report their status as ON for a GoodCheck period of at least 60 seconds.', 'The Hydraulic Brake Booster (HBB) and Anti-Lock Braking (ABS) target states do not report ON for more than 10 hours or both controllers (DPB and ESP) are not operating as expected.', 'Functions in ESP will be available still.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 7933),
  ('ESP_a352_ActuatorLDMFailure', 'Model Y 2025+', 'If Actuation ECU is not able to perform a Global arbitration of LDM function request (e.g. relevant signal information from NET is missing).', 'The condition resets during the same ignition cycle if the DPB signal value and the value configured in the ESP are the same.', 'The brake actuation controller is not able to perform a Longitudinal Dynamics Manager (LDM) global arbitration (e.g. relevant signal information from NET is missing).', 'Functions in ESP will be available still.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 7934),
  ('ESP_a353_PressureSensorImplausHigh', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The pressure sensor shows an unexpected high signal even the plunger is in rest position. A root cause can be a sensor internal condition affecting its operation (e.g. short-circuit of inputs of measurement cell. Monitoring is active if the plunger is in rest position and no hydraulic activation is triggered.)', 'The plunger is in the rest position with no hydraulic activation AND pressure signal is below the default threshold of 50 bar over a designated time period.', 'PressureSensorImplausHigh The pressure sensor shows an unexpected high signal even the plunger is in rest position. A root cause can be a sensor internal failure e.g. short-circuit of inputs of measurement cell.', 'Vehicle Dynamic Control (VDC) / Traction Control (TC) will be unavailable. Anti-Lock Braking System (ABS) will be limited.', 'ABS (anti-lock braking system) disabled', 'Drive with caution', 'customer;service-fix', 7935),
