  ('GTW_w138_sdCardEndOfLife', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The GTW detects its installed microSD card is at or near the microSD card''s maximum rated number of program / erase cycles.', 'The GTW microSD card is replaced with a new one that is not approaching its maximum rated number of program / erase cycles.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects its microSD card has reached or is approaching the end of its expected lifetime and should be replaced.', 'The GTW microSD card may enter read-only mode, which would prevent logging and vehicle software updates.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 8594),
