  ('GTW_w156_PMRELversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'The GTW detects the PMREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the PMREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the rear left Pedal Monitor (PMREL) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'Vehicle is unable to drive until the firmware version mismatch is resolved, to make sure rear left drive unit functionality is not limited or unavailable due to firmware.', 'Incompatible drive system software detected', 'Schedule service - Unable to drive until updated', 'customer;service-fix', 8607),
  ('GTW_w157_DIRELversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'The GTW detects the DIREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the DIREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the rear left drive inverter (DIREL) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'Vehicle is unable to drive until the firmware version mismatch is resolved, to make sure rear left drive unit functionality is not limited or unavailable due to firmware. Inability to use waste heat to supplement high voltage battery heating may make charging at colder temperatures limited or unavailable.', 'Incompatible drive system software detected', 'Schedule service - Unable to drive until updated', 'customer;service-fix', 8608),
