  ('GTW_w169_TPMSsoftWarnFrontLeft', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The TPMS sensor for the front left tire reports an air pressure slightly below the RCP for the vehicle''s region.', 'The TPMS sensor for the front left tire reports an air pressure equaling the RCP for the vehicle''s region.', 'The Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) sensor issues a soft warning, indicating the front left tire is underinflated or is leaking air as the air pressure is slightly below the recommended cold pressure (RCP). This may lead to reduced tire adhesion and control.', 'As the air pressure of the tire is low, adhesion and control may be reduced. Excessive tire wear may also occur.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 8626),
