  ('GTW_w275_VDDCORE_DrMOS_Fault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The alert is set when the DRMOS detects either an over current or over temperature condition on VDDCORE.', 'The alert is cleared when the infotainment computer is power cycled and the over current or over temperature condition no longer exists on VDDCORE.', 'The alert is set when the DRMOS component detects either an over current condition or an over temperature condition on VDDCORE. The infotainment computer is shut down to protect it from damage.', 'The infotainment computer is shut down resulting in a black screen.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 8791),
