  ('GTW_w277_NonRevCDrMOSMitigationFailed', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The mitigation attempt was unsuccessful.', 'The mitigation attempt was successful.', 'The Gateway (GTW) attempted to apply a mitigation for non Rev-C Driver and MOSFET (DrMOS) component by programming the power management controller, but the mitigation attempt was unsuccessful. If the mitigation is unsuccessful, the media control unit (MCU) may be unable to start due to the false detection of over current conditions.', 'The center display may be blank due to the false detection of an over current condition, preventing the MCU from waking.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 8795),
