  ('GTW_w279_adspRepeatedWatchdog', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'There is no communication between the GTW and ADSP.', 'Communication is re-established between the GTW and ADSP after a ADSP reboot.', 'The Audio Digital Signal Processor (ADSP) is being rebooted by the vehicle gateway (GTW) after not responding to pings (communication requests) from the GTW.', 'Audio features will be unavailable until ADSP reboot is complete and communication is re-established.', 'Audio system unavailable - Horn and/or chimes may not function', 'Schedule service if audio system does not recover', 'customer;service', 8797),
