  ('GTW_w299_OPCRELversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck', 'The GTW detects the OPCREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the OPCREL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the rear left Oil Pump Controller (OPCREL) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'Features depending on rear left oil pump functionality may be limited or unavailable. Inability to use waste heat to supplement high voltage battery heating may make charging at colder temperatures limited or unavailable.', 'Incompatible drive system software detected', 'OK to drive - Schedule service to update software', 'customer;service-fix', 8823),
