  ('GTW_w329_FOHMversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2024+;Model Y 2025+', 'The GTW detects the FOHM running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the FOHM running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the Front Overhead Module (FOHM) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'Features depending on FOHM functionality, including the ability to select drive modes, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 8853),
