  ('GTW_w331_SWSRversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2024+;Model Y 2025+', 'The GTW detects the SWSR running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the SWSR running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the right Steering Wheel Switchpack (SWSR) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'Features depending on SWSR functionality, including steering wheel buttons and scroll wheel functions, may be limited or unavailable. Note: No expected impact to steering wheel airbag functionality based on this alert.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 8857),
