  ('GTW_w358_RGBIPFLversionMismatch', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2024+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The GTW detects the RGBIPFL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The GTW no longer detects the RGBIPFL running a different firmware version than expected.', 'The vehicle gateway (GTW) detects the front left Instrument Panel Red Green Blue light (RGBIPFL) electronic control unit (ECU) is running a firmware version that may not be compatible with the firmware installed on the rest of the vehicle.', 'RGB in the front left Instrument Panel may be unavailable or may not function as expected until the firmware version mismatch is resolved.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 8889),
