  ('HVBATT_a200_Bp2AllTempSensorsBad', 'Cybertruck', 'All temperature sensors in subpack 2 are reporting faulty measurement readings.', 'HVBATT receives a valid measurement from any temperature sensor in subpack 2.', 'HVBATT cannot measure the temperature on any module in subpack 2.', 'Inability to charge, drive, or support the Low Voltage (LV) system.', 'Vehicle may not restart', 'Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 9115),
