  ('HVBATT_a225_DiMia', 'Cybertruck', 'DI_systemStatus is not received by HVBATT controller core within the designated message timeout interval.', 'DI_systemStatus is received by HVBATT controller core within the designated message timeout interval.', 'HVBATT''s controller core is not receiving expected messages from the Drive Inverter on the BP CAN bus.', 'Vehicle performance may be reduced.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 9130),
