  ('HVBATT_a259_MaxChargeLevelExceeded', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more Battery Management System (BMS) alerts that reduce the maximum charge limit are set, and the instantaneous charge level is higher than that limit.', 'The HV battery''s charge level falls below the reduced maximum charge limit.', 'The maximum charge level of the high voltage (HV) battery is exceeded.', 'Vehicle will not be able to charge if connected to a power source, as the reduced maximum HV battery charge level is exceeded.', 'Unable to charge - Maximum charge level reached', 'Reduced maximum charge level - Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 9146),
