  ('HVBATT_a263_AcjbBedL3RelayWelded', 'Cybertruck', 'A welded ACJB bed outlet line 3 relay is detected', 'The BMS no longer qualifies the relay as welded.', 'The Battery Management System (BMS) has detected that the AC Junction Box (ACJB) bed outlet line 3 relay has welded.', 'AC charging unavailable.', 'AC charging unavailable - OK to DC Fast Charge', 'Service required to restore AC charging', 'customer;service-fix', 9150),
