  ('HVBATT_a362_EthernetPhyLinkDown', 'Cybertruck', 'Ethernet link is down.', 'Clears when the link is reestablished.', 'The ethernet link is unavailable. Vehicle communications are unable to be transmitted or received from the designated port.', 'Vehicle communications are unable to be transmitted or received from this port.', 'Etherloop degraded', 'One or more links is down', 'service', 9180),
