  ('HVBATT_a388_HvsBusOff', 'Cybertruck', 'HVS bus is experiencing a condition affecting its functionality, causing it to enter the BusOff state.', 'The HVS bus state is stable and no longer in BusOff.', 'The High Voltage System (HVS) bus is in the BusOff state.', 'The HVS bus is unable to communicate with other components, which will lead to vehicle being unable to drive or charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 9182),
