  ('HVLINK_a024_PedalMonitorHvilUnknown', 'Semitruck', 'The PM HVIL is reported as unknown.', 'The PM HVIL must be closed or open.', 'The Pedal Monitor (PM) High Voltage Interlock Loop (HVIL) is reporting as unknown, breaking the overall High Voltage DC Link Controller (HVLINK) HVIL.', 'DC Link may discharge or fail to energize.', 'High voltage system error detected', 'Vehicle may not restart - Service is required', 'customer;service-fix', 9234),
