  ('IDB_a071_DIchassisControlCounter', 'Model Y 2025+', 'DI_chassisControl is received with incorrectly incrementing counter for longer than 200 milliseconds.', 'Clears when DI_chassisControl Controller Area Network (CAN) message is received with correctly incrementing counter for 200 milliseconds.', 'DI chassis control message DI_chassisControl counter is incorrect.', 'The Integrated Dynamic Brake (IDB) may not generate brake torque requested by DI_brakeTorqueCommand. There may be an issue with the transmitting Electronic Control Unit (ECU) or CAN bus.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 10002),
