  ('IDB_a076_DIRtorqueChecksum', 'Model Y 2025+', 'DIR_torque is received with incorrect CRC for longer than 100 milliseconds.', 'Clears when DIR_torque Controller Area Network (CAN) message is received with correct Cyclic Redundancy Check (CRC) for 100 milliseconds.', 'DIR torque message DIR_torque checksum is incorrect.', 'The Integrated Dynamic Brake (IDB) may not generate brake torque requested by DI_brakeTorqueCommandFull and instead generate brake torque requested by DI_brakeTorqueCommand. There may be an issue with the transmitting Electronic Control Unit (ECU) or CAN bus.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 10007),
