  ('PCS2_a094_acChargingUnavailable', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'PCS detects a condition causing AC charging to be unavailable. See alert log signal data for more information.', 'PCS no longer detects the condition affecting AC charging functionality.', 'The Power Conversion System (PCS) detects a condition causing AC charging to be unavailable.', 'The vehicle will be unable to AC charge as expected.', 'AC Charging unavailable', 'Schedule service - Try to DC Fast Charge', 'customer;service-fix', 10502),
