  ('PCS_a077_microGridWobbleDetected', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The PCS ECU detects a wobble signature from the Tesla Powerwall.', 'The PCS ECU no longer detects a wobble signature from the Tesla Powerwall.', 'The Power Conversion System (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) detects a wobble signature from the Tesla Powerwall.', 'No expected impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 10647),
