  ('PCS_a088_gridFreqDroopDetected', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The PCS ECU detects the electrical grid frequency droops below its nominal level.', 'AC charging is stopped.', 'The Power Conversion System (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) detects the electrical grid frequency droops below its nominal level, indicating the grid may be experiencing heavy loads.', 'AC charging power will be temporarily limited depending on the droop level to reduce the load on the electrical grid.', 'Vehicle charging with off-grid Powerwall', 'Charging rate adjusted to allow power sharing', 'customer;service', 10655),
  ('PCS_a089_hvBusDischargeIrrational', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The PCS ECU detects the DCDC converter is unable to regulate the voltage slew rate while the HV bus is discharging.', 'The PCS ECU detects the DCDC converter is able to regulate the voltage slew rate while the HV bus is discharging.', 'The Power Conversion System (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) detects its DCDC converter is unable to regulate the voltage slew rate while the high voltage (HV) bus is discharging, causing the HV bus to discharge outside of the specified slew rate threshold.', 'Vehicle will be unable to precharge. Guobiao direct current (GB DC) and CHAdeMO DC fast charging (FC) may not start or may be interrupted due to CHAdeMO and GB DC compatibility conditions.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 10656),
  ('PCS_a090_expectedAcVoltageSourceMissing', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Charger detects that one or more expected AC voltage sources is missing, possibly due to bad external wiring', 'Charger state machine retries or charge cable is cycled', 'PCS detects one or more power converter expected AC voltage sources are missing, possibly due to bad utility wiring or vehicle HV harness connection.', 'Reduced AC charge rate or inability to AC charge', 'Charging slowed - Some AC phases not powered', 'Check power source and charging equipment', 'customer;service', 10657),
