  ('PCS_a095_dcdcSensorlessModeActive', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'When 5V logic power rail is irrational and DCDC experienced faults when using it is original control scheme', 'When HVP changes its pcs DCDC command from one to another', 'PCS enables the DCDC control to run under sensorless mode, possibly due to some malfunction hardware.', 'DCDC running under sensorless control mode and some DCDC hardware protection may be affected', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 10662),
