  ('PCS_a100_suspectedViperChipIssue', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The PCS ECU detects a viper chip condition preventing the charger phase from boosting the intermediate bus to the specified threshold.', 'AC charging is stopped.', 'The Power Conversion System (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) detects the viper chip is experiencing a condition affecting AC charging functionality.', 'No expected impact on vehicle functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 10665),
