  ('PMR_a058_measuredHvilCurrentFrozen', 'Model 3 2024+;Model Y 2025+', 'The PM detects the measured HVIL current is consistently an irrational value for more than 60 seconds.', 'Clears when the PM no longer detects a consistent irrational HVIL current.', 'The Pedal Monitor (PM) detects that the measured high voltage interlock loop (HVIL) current is consistently an irrational value, which may affect PM functionality.', 'Vehicle functions that depend on PM HVIL statuses may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected. Other alerts may also be present as the  high voltage (HV) battery contactors will be unable to close.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11013),
