  ('PM_a045_regenBackfillIntervention', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The Pedal Monitor sets this alert when sensor or other inputs reporting the state of regen backfill functionality are deemed implausible.', 'This alert will clear on the next drive cycle.', 'The Pedal Monitor has requested the Drive Interface (DI) disable regen backfill torque due to a condition detected affecting regen backfill braking functionality.', 'The safety monitor will disable regen backfill braking torque for the remainder of the drive cycle.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11144),
