  ('PM_a064_torqueIntervention', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The safety monitor sets this condition and indicates diagnostic information in its payload for root cause analysis.', 'This alert will clear on the next drive cycle.', 'Pedal Monitor Warning: Torque Intervention.', 'The safety monitor will inhibit torque and excess heat production for the remainder of the drive cycle.', 'PULL OVER IMMEDIATELY - Unable to drive', 'Exiting and re-entering vehicle may restore operation', 'customer;service', 11157),
