  ('PM_a070_brakeTorqueSplitMonitorTrip', 'Model Y 2025+', 'The Pedal Monitor''s check of the Drive Inverter''s brake pedal command was not as expected', 'The monitor trip will clear on a power cycle', 'The monitor for the brake pedal regenerative braking function has experienced an issue.', 'The yellow brake lamp will be illuminated on the UI and the driver may notice the brake pedal stroke to torque mapping is slightly different', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11165),
