  ('PM_a083_exceptionInfo3', 'Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Semitruck', 'The PM detects a processor exception.', 'This alert clears automatically.', 'The Pedal Monitor (PM) detects an unintended processor reset. This alert is intended for logging purposes and does not on its own indicate a symptom or root cause.', 'This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11178),
