  ('PSFA_a125_EGGRIGHT1_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The local ECU does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EGGRIGHT1 within the expected time frame.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the EGGRIGHT1 ECU are being received or the EGGRIGHT1 ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Etherloop Generalized Gateway Right (Core 1) were not received, indicating the EGGRIGHT1 ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the EGGRIGHT1 may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11441),
  ('PSFA_a127_EGGREAR1_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The local ECU does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EGGREAR1 within the expected time frame.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the EGGREAR1 ECU are being received or the EGGREAR1 ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Etherloop Generalized Gateway Rear (Core 1) were not received, indicating the EGGREAR1 ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the EGGREAR1 may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11442),
  ('PSFA_a128_VCREAR_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCREAR within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCREAR.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear vehicle controller (VCREAR) is not received, indicating the VCREAR may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCREAR may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11443),
  ('PSFA_a130_gatedriverFault', 'Cybertruck', 'The gate driver is reporting an electrical condition affecting its functionality.', 'All gate driver electrical issues have cleared. A stable power supply is necessary. A DRIVE or CONDITIONING cycle is necessary to recover.', 'The gate driver reported an electrical condition preventing operation.', 'The motor is disqualified and system health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11444),
  ('PSFA_a138_currentCalibrationFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Motor phase or bus current calibration offset is out of the nominal range.', 'Idle current readings are within the acceptable range and current calibration is retried. A DRIVE or power cycle is necessary to retry current calibration.', 'Steering current calibration is unsuccessful.', 'The motor is disqualified and system health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11445),
  ('PSFA_a139_motorPositionSensorInvalid', 'Cybertruck', 'Any motor position sensor is deemed invalid, or readings from valid sensors disagree by more than allowed threshold.', 'All motor position sensors must be valid and in agreement.', 'One or more steering motor position sensor readings are invalid.', 'Invalid sensor readings could affect systems reliant on position data.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11446),
  ('PSFA_a145_motorPositionSensorUncalibrated', 'Cybertruck', 'On startup, Electronic Power Steering (EPS) detects motor position sensor calibration is incomplete', 'Calibration of motor position sensor.', 'Motor position sensor is not calibrated.', 'Motor torque may not be generated.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11447),
  ('PSFA_a146_motorUncalibrated', 'Cybertruck', 'On startup, Electronic Power Steering (EPS) detects motor calibration is incomplete', 'Calibration of motor.', 'Motor is not calibrated.', 'Motor torque may not be generated.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11448),
  ('PSFA_a149_MAQ473GQEFault', 'Cybertruck', 'The motor position sensor experiences an issue affecting configuration and/or communication, or magnetic flags are set.', 'The sensor configuration is successful, the angle reading is active and valid, and there are no magnetic flags set.', 'The primary motor position sensor has been deemed invalid.', 'The motor is disqualified and handwheel feedback health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11449),
  ('PSFA_a159_currentContinuityFault', 'Cybertruck', 'Observed current into motor does not match current exiting.', 'Current returns to nominal.', 'Steering motor current continuity is irrational. The sum of the three phase currents is not equal to 0.', 'The motor is disqualified and system health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11450),
  ('PSFA_a160_TLE5501Fault', 'Cybertruck', 'The motor position sensor signals have failed a safety check.', 'The alert will clear if the motor position sensor signals satisfy safety requirements for a sufficient window. The steering rack should be replaced.', 'The primary motor position sensor has been deemed invalid.', 'The motor is disqualified and rack control health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11451),
  ('PSFA_a161_largeCurrentOffset', 'Cybertruck', 'A phase current offset greater than the expected variance is detected.', 'Current calibration re-runs. Calibration is done during start-up, and the condition may resolve during a vehicle power cycle.', 'A phase current offset of a steering controller is greater than the expected variance. Steering may not operate as expected.', 'Steering may not operate as expected. Controller may be damaged.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11452),
  ('PSFA_a173_thermalDerating', 'Cybertruck', 'When part of steering system is detected to be close to its overheating limit.', 'Once Steering system cools back down.', 'Steering system may be reducing power and functionality to prevent overheating, due to higher than nominal system temperature detected.', 'Torque output may be reduced, and steering system may have reduced performance.', 'Steering performance reduced due to overheating', 'Reduce amount of steering input to cool system', 'customer;service-fix', 11453),
  ('PSFA_a191_handwheelMedianCheckFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more angle sources is not within the velocity dependent allowed error bounds.', 'All sources reported handwheel rotation within error bounds.', 'Handwheel rotation delta comparison with other sources failed.', 'Loss of steering feedback.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11454),
  ('PSFA_a192_handwheelNotCalibrated', 'Cybertruck', 'Uncalibrated handwheel detected.', 'Handwheel calibration detected.', 'The handwheel has not been calibrated.', 'Steering control from this node is disabled.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11455),
  ('PSFA_a196_handwheelDegraded', 'Cybertruck', 'The median check fault counter has started to count up.', 'All sources reported handwheel rotation within error bounds and are valid.', 'The median check fault counter has started to count up.', 'Loss of redundancy in steering feedback.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11456),
  ('PSFA_a198_sccmOffsetNotCalibrated', 'Cybertruck', 'Uncalibrated SCCM steering angle detected.', 'SCCM steering angle calibration detected.', 'The Steering Column Control Module (SCCM) steering angle has not been calibrated.', 'Steering performance may be degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11457),
  ('PSFA_a199_factoryFuseMotorMissing', 'Cybertruck', 'Motor factory calibration record missing or invalid.', 'Motor factory calibration record present and valid.', 'The motor factory calibration record is missing or invalid.', 'Motor factory calibration may be missing, preventing operation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11458),
  ('PSFA_a208_startupSequenceFailed2', 'Cybertruck', 'Controller calibration check is unsuccessful, corresponding controller monitor is not responding, or state timeout occurs.', 'Startup sequence passes. Startup sequence is run during vehicle startup, and the condition may resolve by drive cycling the vehicle.', 'Power steering startup sequence is unsuccessful.', 'The motor is disqualified and system health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11459),
  ('PSFA_a209_startupSequenceFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Controller calibration check is unsuccessful, corresponding controller monitor is not responding, or state timeout occurs.', 'Startup sequence passes. Startup sequence is run during vehicle startup, and the condition may resolve by drive cycling the vehicle.', 'Power steering startup sequence is unsuccessful.', 'The motor is disqualified and system health is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11460),
  ('PSFA_a211_handwheelCalNeedsRefinement', 'Cybertruck', 'Handwheel calibration is captured during the FIND-CENTER routine.', 'Calibrate handwheel using inclinometer.', 'Handwheel center is calibrated to center of mechanism and may be offset from visual center.', 'Vehicle does not drive straight while holding the handwheel at visual center.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11461),
  ('PSFA_a218_steeringDeratedByWinch', 'Cybertruck', 'Transport Mode is enabled.', 'Transport Mode is disabled.', 'Steering power is reduced as Transport Mode has been enabled.', 'Steering performance may be reduced until Transport Mode is disabled.', 'Steering functions limited in Transport Mode', 'Exit Transport Mode to restore', 'customer;service', 11462),
  ('PSFA_a219_steeringDeratedByJumpPost', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle enters Drive state while being powered by the jump post.', 'The vehicle exits Drive state while being powered by the jump post.', 'Steering power is reduced as the vehicle has entered Drive power state while being powered by the jump post.', 'Steering performance may be reduced until the vehicle exits then re-enters Drive state (vehicle power cycle occurs) with the jump post power source disconnected.', 'Steering functions limited by jump post', 'Remove jump power to restore on next drive', 'customer;service', 11463),
  ('PSFA_a251_lateralControlFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Any condition affecting steering system functionality that will prevent operation / make the steering system unable to follow commands.', 'All conditions making steering system unable to respond to commands are resolved, and a new drive cycle starts.', 'Steering system unable to follow commands due to one or more conditions affecting functionality.', 'Vehicle is unable to drive or continue driving.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11464),
  ('PSFA_a252_steeringDegradedByVehicle', 'Cybertruck', 'Any condition detected affecting steering system functionality.', 'All conditions affecting steering system functionality are resolved, and a new drive cycle starts.', 'Steering system performance degraded due to condition detected affecting functionality.', 'Steering system performance is degraded, and vehicle speed is limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11465),
  ('PSFA_a260_steeringInternalFault', 'Cybertruck', 'Any condition detected affecting steering system functionality.', 'All conditions affecting steering system functionality are resolved, and a new drive cycle starts.', 'Steering system performance degraded due to condition detected affecting functionality.', 'Steering system performance is degraded, and vehicle speed is limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11466),
  ('PSFA_a275_ECUMiaOnInternalBus', 'Cybertruck', 'The local Electronic Control Unit (ECU) did not receive a message it was expecting from the ECUs on the specified internal steering bus within the expected timeout.', 'The local ECU begins receiving all expected messages from the specified internal steering bus.', 'The local Electronic Control Unit (ECU) has not received one or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the internal steering bus.', 'Power Steering functionality may be degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11467),
  ('RADC_a001_can1BusOff', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'Set when transmit error count is above 255, Per ISO 11898-1.', 'A 12v reset will clear the transmit error', 'Secondary CAN Bus Off.', 'None', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 11468),
  ('RADC_a002_ecuAdcError', 'Semitruck', 'to do', 'to do', 'ADC Issue.', 'to do', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11469),
  ('RADC_a002_ecuAdcError', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'RADC detects a condition with the ADC.', 'RADC no longer detects a condition with the ADC.', 'The radar circuit (RADC) has detected a condition with the analog / digital converters (ADC). RADC may not operate as expected.', 'The RADC might not operate as expected and may compromise radar-based functionalities on the vehicle.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11470),
  ('RADC_a003_ecuBistDisabled', 'Semitruck', 'to do', 'to do', 'ECU Internal fault - Memory Built in Self Test Disabled.', 'to do', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11471),
  ('RADC_a003_ecuBistDisabled', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'RADC detects a condition with the BIST.', 'RADC no longer detects a condition with the BIST.', 'The radar circuit (RADC) has detected that the memory built in self-test (BIST) has been disabled. RADC may not operate as expected.', 'The RADC might not operate as expected and may compromise radar-based functionalities on the vehicle.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11472),
