  ('RADC_a018_internalHardwareFault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'RADC detects an unexpected hardware reset.', 'RADC detects the condition causing the unexpected hardware reset has been resolved and the system is functioning properly.', 'The radar circuit (RADC) has detected an unexpected hardware reset. RADC may not operate as expected.', 'The RADC might not operate as expected and may compromise radar-based functionalities on the vehicle.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11496),
