  ('RADC_a021_overTempCrit', 'Cybertruck', 'RADC detects a temperature that has exceeded a critical limit.', 'RADC no longer detects a temperature that has exceeded a critical limit.', 'The radar circuit (RADC) has detected a temperature that has exceeded a critical limit. RADC may not operate as expected.', 'The RADC might not operate as expected and may compromise radar-based functionalities on the vehicle.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 11501);

