  ('RSA_a117_VCRIGHT_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCRIGHT within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCRIGHT.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the right vehicle controller (VCRIGHT) is not received, indicating the VCRIGHT may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCRIGHT may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13004),
