  ('SDCF_a001_powerOnSelfTestFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when Pyro test voltages are out of range during pyro self-test.', 'Clears after a power cycle when the pyro self-test completes successfully.', 'The Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) did not pass the drive unit pyro self-test.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Powertrain requires service', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited', 'service-fix', 13127),
  ('SDCF_a004_pmRunningFdbkIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when DI UART data is active but running-feedback pin state is low.', 'Clears when DI running-feedback pin is set, or Universal Asynchronous Receiver-Transmitter (UART) communication stops.', 'Drive Inverter (DI) running-feedback (fdbk) pin to Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) is in an irrational state.', 'The SDC may not detect that the drive inverter is present at startup, which could result in overlapping pyro self-tests.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13128),
  ('SDCF_a005_motorSpeedIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC estimated motor speed is too high or too low.', 'Clears when the SDC motor speed estimate returns to a valid range.', 'The Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) motor speed estimate is irrational.', 'Some SDC functions may be unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13129),
  ('SDCF_a006_pyroTriggered', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC detects abnormal electrical condition.', 'Clears on SDC processor reset.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) triggered the two-phase disconnect mechanism.', 'Drive unit may be permanently disabled after two-phase disconnect occurs.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13130),
  ('SDCF_a007_faultCurrentsDetected', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when abnormal drive unit currents are detected by the SDC while Drive Inverter (DI) is not switching.', 'Clears when drive unit can control currents rationally or SDC processor is reset.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) detected abnormal motor currents.', 'SDC may trigger the pyro disconnect.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13131),
  ('SDCF_a008_hvlinkMIA', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when at least one message from HVLINK consumed by SDC is not received.', 'Clears when all HVLINK messages consumed by SDC are received.', 'High Voltage DC Link Controller (HVLINK) messages are not being received by Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC).', 'Active discharge control by SDC may be forced ON.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13132),
  ('SDCF_a009_uartVersionMismatch', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when UART data version detected as differing between DI and SDC.', 'Clears when UART data version between SDC and DI is identical.', 'Universal Asynchronous Receiver-Transmitter (UART) data version differs between Drive Inverter (DI) and Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC).', 'Unable to run pyro self-test.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13133),
  ('SDCF_a010_vrefIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC reference voltage (Vref) measurement is outside of expected range.', 'Clears when reference voltage (Vref) is within expected range.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) reference voltage (Vref) for current sensor measurement is irrational, making SDC unable to monitor drive unit electrical state.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13134),
  ('SDCF_a011_phaseCurrentOffset', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when phase current sensor offset is higher or lower than expected limit.', 'Clears when phase current sensor offset falls within expected limits.', 'At least one phase current sensor offset is outside of the expected limits.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13135),
  ('SDCF_a012_vBoostSecIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC boost rail sensor reading is below operational value while HV backup rail voltage measurement (Vbackup) is at nominal value.', 'Clears when boost rail sensor voltage reading falls within a nominal or expected range.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) boost rail voltage sensor is providing irrational values.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13136),
  ('SDCF_a013_vBkupIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when HV backup rail voltage measured low while Power Good (PGOOD) hardware signal to SDC is asserted.', 'Clears when HV backup rail voltage reads within nominal or expected range.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) High Voltage (HV) backup rail voltage sensor is providing irrational values.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13137),
  ('SDCF_a014_vBusIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when HV bus voltage measurement is low while HV backup rail is up.', 'Clears when HV bus voltage measurement is within rational or expected range.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) High Voltage (HV) bus voltage sensor is providing irrational values.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Powertrain requires service', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited', 'service-fix', 13138),
  ('SDCF_a015_phaseVIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when at least one phase voltage measurement remains low while voltage should be constantly switching between low and high.', 'Clears when all phase voltage measurements are within rational or expected range.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) phase voltage sensors are providing irrational values.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13139),
  ('SDCF_a017_adcSPIError', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when invalid data is received from the external ADC over SPI.', 'Clears when valid data is received from the external ADC.', 'The external Analog to Digital Converter (ADC) is returning invalid data over the Serial Peripheral Interface (SPI).', 'Phase voltage sensing data is incorrect, which may affect pyro disconnect functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13140),
  ('SDCF_a018_historicalPyroTrigger', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC reads alert log signal data from EEPROM for a previous pyro disconnect event.', 'Clears when SDC Power-ON self-test is successful.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) triggered the two-phase disconnect mechanism during a previous power ON state. Alert log signal data retrieved from Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory (EEPROM) to be used for pyro disconnect trigger investigation afterward.', 'Drive unit may not be functional due to previous pyro disconnect.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13141),
  ('SDCF_a019_historicalFaultCurrents', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when SDC detects abnormal electrical currents while Drive Inverter (DI) is not switching as expected during a previous power cycle.', 'Clears when SDC completes successful power-ON self-test.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) detected abnormal electrical currents during a previous power-ON state. Data retrieved from Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory (EEPROM).', 'Drive unit may not be functional due to previous electrical condition.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13142),
  ('SDCF_a020_eepromSPIError', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when invalid data received from external EEPROM over SPI.', 'Clears when valid data is received from the external EEPROM.', 'The external Electrically Erasable Programmable Read-Only Memory (EEPROM) is returning unexpected data over the Serial Peripheral Interface (SPI).', 'Analysis of trigger condition for a previous pyro disconnect event cannot be completed because EEPROM data is inaccessible.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13143),
  ('SDCF_a021_busBarTempIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when at least one SDC bus bar temperature sensor value is outside expected range.', 'Clears when all bus bar temperature sensor values are within rational bounds.', 'Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) bus bar temperature sensors providing irrational values.', 'At least one bus bar temperature is unavailable, which may affect pyro disconnect functionality.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13144),
  ('SDCF_a024_gtwMIA', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when at least one message from the GTW consumed by the SDC is not received.', 'Clears when all GTW messages consumed by the SDC are received.', 'At least one message the Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) expects to receive from the vehicle gateway (GTW) is not received.', 'Timestamp for any ECULOG capturing internal SDC data will be inaccurate, which may complicate diagnosis.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13145),
  ('SDCF_a025_diSwitchingFdbkIrrational', 'Cybertruck', 'Sets when DI switching-feedback pin is set but DI running-feedback is cleared.', 'Clears when the DI switching-feedback pin state matches the expected state based on the DI running-feedback pin.', 'Drive Inverter (DI) switching-feedback pin to Secondary Disconnect Controller (SDC) is in an irrational state.', 'Pyro disconnect may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 13146),
