  ('SEPSM_a125_EGGRIGHT1_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The local ECU does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EGGRIGHT1 within the expected time frame.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the EGGRIGHT1 ECU are being received or the EGGRIGHT1 ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Etherloop Generalized Gateway Right (Core 1) were not received, indicating the EGGRIGHT1 ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the EGGRIGHT1 may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13319),
