  ('TAS_a177_hvPackPressurizationFault', 'Cybertruck', 'Alert log signal data should provide more information on how the system was unable to pressurize the pack due to hardware issues related to airlines, pressure sensor, or valves.', 'This alert is used for logging purposes only and clears automatically when the pressurize pack routine is run again.', 'The pressurized high voltage (HV) battery pack routine is unable to confirm the Scuba valve is performing as designed.', 'Wade Mode is not available and the HV battery pack may be susceptible to water if submerged.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 13954),
