  ('TAS_a218_limpHomeMode40', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2012-2020;Model S 2021+;Model X 2015-2020;Model X 2021+;Model Y 2025+', 'The ECU has detected an issue whose severity requires operating under limp home mode 40 restrictions.', 'Vehicle-power-state cycle from off to on.', 'Air suspension system is operating under limp home mode 40 restrictions.', 'Air suspension leveling will be disabled.', 'Air suspension adjustment unavailable', 'Functionality may be restored on next drive', 'customer;service', 13970),
