  ('UI_a013_TPMSHardWarning', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'Air pressure of at least one tire is very low, set by TPMS ecu (threshold may vary)', 'Check and inflate tire(s)', 'Air pressure of at least one tire is very low, may have a puncture. Check and inflate tire(s).', 'Tire pressure very low. Potential puncture. Reduced adhesion and control, excessive tire wear', 'Air pressure in tires very low', 'PULL OVER SAFELY - Check for flat tire', 'customer;service-fix', 14438),
  ('UI_a014_TPMSSoftWarning', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'The air pressure of the tire(s) is below the recommended threshold.', 'The tire(s) are inflated to the recommended air pressure threshold.', 'The air pressure of the tire(s) is below the recommended threshold, which is determined by the Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) electronic control unit (ECU). This may lead to reduced tire adhesion and control.', 'Since the air pressure of the tire(s) is low, adhesion and control may be reduced. Excessive tire wear may also occur.', 'Air pressure below recommendation for tires', 'Check pressure and refill air as needed', 'customer;service-fix', 14439),
