  ('UI_a037_AudioWatchdogXrunStormError', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'Audio stack is resetting within 1 minute of the vehicle waking while parked. This is due to rapidly recurring XRUN messages (40 messages in 1 second) present in the logs. XRUN events correspond with vehicle buffer and occur when a stream is closed, interrupted, or high system load.', 'Reboot the audio stack.', 'Audio stack is resetting within 1 minute of the vehicle waking while parked. This is due to recurring XRUN messages present in the logs.', 'Vehicle audio and user interface (UI) may not behave as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 14460),
