  ('UI_a211_AEBSDisabled', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'AEBS feature enabled in the region and faulted.', 'AEBS feature functions normally.', 'Active Safety Automatic Emergency Braking System (AEBS) feature faulted.', 'Potential loss of AEBS active safety feature.', 'Automatic Emergency Braking is disabled', 'Not Available', 'customer;service', 14586),
