  ('UI_a213_ISADisabled', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'ISA feature is enabled in the vehicle''s region and experienced an user action that disables the feature.', 'ISA is unmuted or user gets out of the mode they are in.', 'Intelligent Speed Assist (ISA) feature is disabled during this time.', 'ISA active safety feature is disabled by user action.', 'Intelligent Speed Assist disabled', 'Not Available', 'customer;service', 14588),
