  ('VCDOORRL_a089_IBST_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the iBooster ECU has not been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the iBooster is CAN active.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the iBooster ECU are being received or the iBooster ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from iBooster were not received.', 'Brake boost functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15303),
  ('VCDOORRL_a091_CMPD_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the CMPD ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CMPD ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the heat pump system compressor (CMPD) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CMPD ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The HVAC system may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15304),
  ('VCDOORRL_a092_VCSEATD_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the VCSEATD is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCSEATD.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the driver seat controller (VCSEATD) is not received, indicating the VCSEATD may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Driver seat features depending on VCSEATD functionality, including seat buckle and heating pad, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15305),
  ('VCDOORRL_a093_VCSEATP_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the VCSEATP is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCSEATP.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the front passenger seat controller (VCSEATP) is not received, indicating the VCSEATP may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Front passenger seat features depending on VCSEATP functionality, including seat buckle and heating pad, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15306),
  ('VCDOORRL_a094_EPAS3P_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the EPAS3P ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the EPAS3P ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Primary Electronic Power-Assisted Steering (EPAS3P) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the EPAS3P ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the EPAS3P may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15307),
  ('VCDOORRL_a095_CHG_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the CHG ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CHG ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the onboard charger (CHG) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CHG ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Charging may not start or may be interrupted unexpectedly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15308),
  ('VCDOORRL_a096_OCS1P_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the OCS1P ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the OCS1P ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the 1st row passenger occupancy classification system (OCS1P) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the OCS1P ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the OCS1P may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15309),
  ('VCDOORRL_a097_CMP_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the CMP ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CMP ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the air conditioning compressor (CMP) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CMP ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The HVAC system may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15310),
  ('VCDOORRL_a098_DIR_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DIR ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DIR ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear drive inverter (DIR) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the DIR ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15311),
  ('VCDOORRL_a099_PARK_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'An expected CAN message from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the park assist ECU is CAN active. The PARK ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_chGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_parkLVState is LV_ON.', 'All expected CAN messages  from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the PARK ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15312),
  ('VCDOORRL_a100_CANbus_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'If 50% or more of the ECUs the local ECUs listens to are MIA, and the local ECU receives from more than 3 ECUs on this bus. An ECU is MIA if more than 50% of its messages are MIA and that ECU is considered CAN active (see specific ECU''s MIA alert for CAN active conditions).', 'setCondition is no longer true.', 'More than half of the ECUs on a either the VEH or PARTY bus are missing more than half their messages while the bus should be active.', 'Vehicle functionality may be degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15313),
  ('VCDOORRL_a101_PM_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PM ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PM ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Pedal Monitor (PM) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PM ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15314),
  ('VCDOORRL_a102_PTC_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PTC heater ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PTC heater ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Positive Temperature Coefficient (PTC) heater electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PTC heater ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Thermal management system features depending on PTC heater functionality may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15315),
  ('VCDOORRL_a103_CP_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the CP ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CP ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the charge port (CP) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CP ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Charging may not start or may be interrupted unexpectedly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15316),
  ('VCDOORRL_a105_TAS_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the TAS ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the TAS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Tesla Air Suspension (TAS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the TAS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The air suspension may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15317),
  ('VCDOORRL_a106_PCS_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PCS ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PCS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the power conversion system (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PCS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The vehicle may be unable to charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15318),
  ('VCDOORRL_a107_BMS_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the HVBMS ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the HVBMS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the high voltage (HV) Battery Management System (BMS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the BMS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The vehicle may be unable to drive or charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15319),
  ('VCDOORRL_a108_DIF_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DIF ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DIF ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the front drive inverter (DIF) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the DIF ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited. Thermal management system features depending on DIF functionality may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15320),
  ('VCDOORRL_a110_GTW_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'An expected CAN message from the vehicle gateway (GTW) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the GTW is CAN active. The GTW is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) are received, or the GTW is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) was not received. Vehicle functions  that depend on CAN messages from the GTW may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Vehicle functions that depend on CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15321),
  ('VCDOORRL_a111_EPBR_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EPBR ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the EPBR ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the right Electronic Park Brake (EPBR) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the EPBR ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The parking brake may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15322),
  ('VCDOORRL_a112_EPBL_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EPBL ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the EPBL ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the left Electronic Park Brake (EPBL) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the EPBL ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The parking brake may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15323),
  ('VCDOORRL_a114_ESP_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'An expected CAN message from the Electronic Stability Program (ESP) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the ESP is CAN active. The ESP is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_privateGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_espLVState is LV_ON.', 'All expected CAN messages from the Electronic Stability Program (ESP) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the ESP ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Electronic Stability Program (ESP) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. Stability and traction control functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Stability and traction control functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15324),
  ('VCDOORRL_a115_VCSEC_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCSEC within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCSEC.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the vehicle security controller (VCSEC) is not received, indicating the VCSEC may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Features depending on VCSEC functionality, including vehicle security and communication with authentication devices, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15325),
  ('VCDOORRL_a116_VCRIGHT_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCRIGHT within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCRIGHT.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the right vehicle controller (VCRIGHT) is not received, indicating the VCRIGHT may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCRIGHT may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15326),
  ('VCDOORRL_a117_VCLEFT_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCLEFT within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCLEFT.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the left vehicle controller (VCLEFT) is not received, indicating the VCLEFT may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCLEFT may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15327),
  ('VCDOORRL_a118_VCFRONT_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the VCFRONT within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCFRONT.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the front vehicle controller (VCFRONT) is not received, indicating the VCFRONT may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCFRONT may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15328),
  ('VCDOORRL_a119_SCCM_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the SCCM is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the SCCM.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Steering Column Control Module (SCCM) is not received, indicating the SCCM may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle may be unable to shift between drive modes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15329),
  ('VCDOORRL_a120_DI_DRIVE_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DI ECU is not received while the vehicle is in Drive.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DI ECU while the vehicle is in Drive, or the vehicle is no longer in Drive.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the drive interface (DI) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received while the vehicle is in Drive, indicating the DI ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15330),
  ('VCDOORRL_a121_eFuseManagementContinuous16V', 'Cybertruck', 'Voltage is above 10V for 200ms on at least one of the device outputs while none of them are being driven', 'Voltage is below 10V and 10 seconds have passed since alert was set. If the alert sets 3 or more times, controller reset is required.', 'Unexpected voltage seen on continuous device outputs.', 'Electrical loads for door switch LED, door pocket LED, door puddle LED, and power 15v0 sw fused rail may be unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15331),
  ('VCDOORRL_a122_eFuseManagementNonContinuous16V', 'Cybertruck', 'Voltage is above 10V for 200ms on at least one of the device outputs while none of them are being driven', 'Voltage is below 10V and 10 seconds have passed since alert was set. If the alert sets 3 or more times, controller reset is required.', 'Unexpected voltage seen on non-continuous device outputs.', 'Electrical loads for mirror tilt up/down, mirror tilt left/right, mirror fold out/in, and mirror motor control may be unavailable.', 'Mirror fold and tilt functions limited', 'Electrical issue - Schedule service soon', 'customer;service-fix', 15332),
  ('VCDOORRL_a150_windowPinch', 'Cybertruck', 'Window pinch condition detected, see alert payload for pinch reason', 'Immediate', 'Window pinch event detected.', 'Window will not complete actuation and reverse', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15333),
  ('VCDOORRL_a152_windowUncal', 'Cybertruck', 'Window Uncalibrated: calibration routine was never run, was unsuccessful, or the window recorded reaching an impossible position', 'Close window completely with door latched', 'Window is not calibrated.', 'May short drop and reverse at all positions, no anti-pinch detection', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15334),
  ('VCDOORRL_a154_windowThermal', 'Cybertruck', 'Repeated window cycling in a short period of time', 'Allow time for the window motor to cool', 'Window thermal protection mode engaged.', 'No user-initiated down/closing movement permitted in THERMAL_ALERT mode, no user-initiated movement permitted in THERMAL_CRITICAL mode', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15335),
  ('VCDOORRL_a156_windowNoInput', 'Cybertruck', 'Repeated window cycling in a short period of time', 'Initiate movement via window switches after window motor has cooled and window is no longer in thermal protection mode.', 'Window thermal protection mode is activated and user input was attempted, but blocked.', 'User commands for window open or all user commands are ignored (depending on which thermal protection mode is set) until window motor cools', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15336),
  ('VCDOORRL_a158_windowPinchOveride', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller detects window pinch detection has been overriden by holding auto-up switch.', 'Auto-up switch is no longer held while window pinch is detected.', 'Window pinch detection has been overriden by holding the auto-up window switch.', 'Window pinch detection is unavailable while the condition persists, as pinch detection is not enabled when overriden by holding the auto-up switch.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15337),
  ('VCDOORRL_a160_windowUndercurrent', 'Cybertruck', 'Measured window current is less than the expected threshold for a defined period of time. The window may be disconnected or shorted.', 'Window is successfully driven and the expected amount of current supplied is present.', 'Window current is less than expected while the window is driven.', 'Window may not open or close as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15338),
  ('VCDOORRL_a162_windowEncoderStall', 'Cybertruck', 'Window motor is being driven and no encoder feedback is seen within 500 ms', 'Window motor is successfully driven and encoder feedback is seen', 'Window encoder ticks not seen while the front window motor is being driven: This suggests something is disconnected, shorted, or the controller voltage supply for the encoders is < 9V.', 'Window motor is possibly disconnected or shorted', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15339),
  ('VCDOORRL_a180_doorLatchRehome', 'Cybertruck', 'The latch is not performing a release but the home switch on the release actuator is deactivated.', 'The latch''s home switch is activated, usually as a result of an automatic rehome. This may also temporarily clear after a normal powered release.', 'The door latch had to be rehomed because of an unexpected movement in the latch''s release motor.', 'Until this alert clears, the door latch may spontaneously release.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15340),
  ('VCDOORRL_a182_emergencyLatchRel', 'Cybertruck', 'The mechanical release was used to open the door.', 'Door is closed.', 'The mechanical release was used to open the door.', 'Possible damage to window trim.', 'Manual door release used', 'May cause damage to window trim', 'customer;service', 15341),
  ('VCDOORRL_a186_latchReleaseFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Latch state transitions from opening to closed', 'Latch reports open or temporarily open during a powered release', 'Door does not open when requested due to the latch not releasing when expected.', 'Door will not open', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15342),
  ('VCDOORRL_a188_latchUnableToRearm', 'Cybertruck', 'Door latch actuator does not reset the release cam to the home position in the time allotted', 'Home switch reports a homed or temporarily homed state during a powered release', 'Door latch release cam cannot find home position.', 'Door may not be able to close', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15343),
  ('VCDOORRL_a202_IMUFaultDetected', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller detects a condition affecting IMU functionality.', 'The IMU has recovered from the condition affecting functionality.', 'The vehicle controller has detected a condition affecting Inertial Measurement Unit (IMU) functionality, triggering the IMU recovery process.', 'Vehicle functionality depending on the IMU may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15344),
  ('VCDOORRL_a286_windowSpeedInvalid', 'Cybertruck', 'Vehicle controller detects window speed is too fast or in the wrong direction.', 'Vehicle controller no longer detects window speed is too fast or in the wrong direction.', 'Window speed is too fast or in the wrong direction.', 'Windows may lose calibration.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15345),
  ('VCDOORRL_a330_shortDropFailed', 'Cybertruck', 'Door Vehicle Controller (VCDOOR) is unable to roll down the window when opening the door.', 'New short drop motion is attempted.', 'Window glass did not short drop while opening the door.', 'Window glass is fully open. User may cause bright damage and experience difficulty closing the door if window is not lowered before closing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15346),
  ('VCDOORRL_a336_windowDropRevThermal', 'Cybertruck', 'Window motor thermal protection is enabled preventing the window from short drop reversing.', 'New window movement started.', 'Window glass did not roll back up after closing the door.', 'Window may be left slightly open.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15347),
  ('VCDOORRL_a373_windowSwOpenReqInDogMode', 'Cybertruck', 'Window switch open request occurs when Dog Mode is active', 'Dog Mode is deactivated or 5 seconds has elapsed since last window switch open request with Dog Mode active', 'Window switch open requests are ignored when Dog Mode is active to prevent pet escape.', 'Window will not open from switch request', 'Window switch opening disabled in Pet Mode', 'Disable Pet Mode to resume window operation', 'customer', 15348),
  ('VCDOORRL_a375_windowPinchOverrideNudge', 'Cybertruck', 'Two window pinch events occur within 30 seconds of each other', 'Alert clears after 20s or if the window becomes fully closed', 'Two window pinch events occured within 30 seconds of each other.', 'Window pinch sensitivity will be greatly reduced', 'Window closing interrupted due to obstacle', 'Pull and hold switch until fully closed to override', 'customer', 15349),
  ('VCDOORRL_a400_presenterUncal', 'Cybertruck', 'Door presenter lost calibration or calibration routine is unable to complete successfully', 'Door presenter becomes calibrated or the presenter calibration routine is run successfully', 'Door Presenter is not calibrated.', 'Door will not present from the exterior button making it hard to open the door', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15350),
  ('VCDOORRL_a401_presenterUnknownBodyPosition', 'Cybertruck', 'Door presenter lost the body position or the body find routine is unable to complete successfully', 'Door presenter learns the body position or the presenter body find routine is run successfully when the door is closed', 'Door Presenter has not learned or does not know where the body of the vehicle is.', 'Door presenting will be slow from the exterior button', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15351),
  ('VCDOORRL_a402_presenterUnexpectedStop', 'Cybertruck', 'Door presenter experiences an unexpected stop.', 'Door presenter moves again.', 'Door presenter has stopped for unexpected reasons.', 'Door presenter may require calibration or replacement.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15352),
  ('VCDOORRL_a409_presenterStuckOut', 'Cybertruck', 'Door presenter is not in the fully retracted position with a valid retract reason', 'Door presenter becomes fully retracted', 'Door presenter is stuck presented even through there is a valid retract request.', 'Door will get stuck open unless the presenter is physically back driven to fully retracted', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15353),
  ('VCDOORRL_a410_waitingForSoftStallTimeout', 'Cybertruck', 'Presenter does not reach the soft stalling state within the timeout period.', 'Clears automatically.', 'Presenter did not reach the soft stalling state within the allotted wait time.', 'Door will not present, making it difficult to open.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15354),
  ('VCDOORRL_a411_presenterDisconnected', 'Cybertruck', 'Current draw falls below the undercurrent threshold and no encoder counts are seen when a high enough voltage is applied to the presenter motor', 'Current or encoder ticks are seen. Reconnect presenter and run the calibration routine to attempt to clear alert', 'Lack of current and encoder ticks from the presenter indicates it is no longer connected to the controlller.', 'Door will not present from an exterior button press and may get stuck out, preventing the door from closing', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15355),
  ('VCDOORRL_a414_undervoltageSelfTestFailure', 'Cybertruck', 'The VCDOOR undervoltage self-test does not succeed. If a stuck-on or stuck-off condition is present, specific information can be found in the undervoltage self-test stuck-on or stuck-off debugging alerts.', 'Successful VCDOOR undervoltage self-test.', 'The Door Vehicle Controller (VCDOOR) self-test did not pass, as a condition affecting a load on the VCDOOR was detected during the self-test.', 'The vehicle may not allow drive or some loads may not turn on.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15356),
  ('VCDOORRL_a415_undervoltageSelfTestStuckOff', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more loads did not turn on during the VCDOOR undervoltage self-test.', 'The VCDOOR undervoltage self-test is run again and the load is turned on successfully.', 'One or more loads did not turn on during the Door Vehicle Controller (VCDOOR) undervoltage self-test. Those loads will be inhibited from use while in Drive.', 'Impacted load(s) will not be usable in Drive.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15357),
  ('VCDOORRL_a425_doorPresenterAbuseEventDetected', 'Cybertruck', 'Door presenter detects an abuse event', 'The door presenter finishes movement', 'The door presenter has determined that an abuse event has occurred.', 'Door presenter may have sustained damage and may require inspection and/or replacment', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15358),
  ('VCDOORRL_a483_undervoltageSelfTestStuckOnDebug', 'Cybertruck', 'The Door Domain Undervoltage self-test does not succeed.', 'Vehicle controller reset or successful Door Domain Undervoltage self-test.', 'The Door Domain Undervoltage self-test did not pass, as a condition affecting a load on the Door Domain was detected during the self-test.', 'The undervoltage protection circuit may not be functional. This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15359),
  ('VCDOORRL_a484_undervoltageSelfTestStuckOn', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more loads did not turn off during the VCDOOR Undervoltage self-test.', 'The VCDOOR Undervoltage self-test is ran again and the load is turned off successfully.', 'One or more loads did not turn off during the VCDOOR Undervoltage self-test.', 'Impacted load(s) can not be turned off. This alert is primarily informational and is used for logging purposes.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15360),
  ('VCDOORRL_a500_interiorTrimConnectorUnplugged', 'Cybertruck', 'Interior door trim connector detected as unplugged for more than 1 second', 'Interior door trim connector detected as connected for more than 1 second', 'The interior door trim connector appears to be unplugged from the door controller based on the voltages from the interior door release button and window switch(es).', 'The interior door release button and window switch(es) will be unavailable', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15361),
  ('VCDOORRL_a551_interiorDoorRequestInhibited', 'Cybertruck', 'The occupant requests an interior door release while Autopilot has inhibited release due to detecting an oncoming pedestrian, vehicle or cyclist.', 'Clears automatically 8 seconds after inhibited door release request.', 'An interior door release request is inhibited by Autopilot because of a passing pedestrian, vehicle or cyclist. Pressing the interior door release button a second time will allow the door to open.', 'The occupant''s interior door release request is temporarily inhibited.', 'Door opening prevented - Check surroundings', 'Passing pedestrian, bike or vehicle detected', 'customer', 15362),
  ('VCDOORRL_a578_RGBLightFault', 'Cybertruck', 'A condition affecting RGB light communication or functionality is detected. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific condition and RGB light affected.', 'No condition affecting RGB light communication or functionality is detected.', 'A Red Green Blue (RGB) light error has been detected.', 'RGB light may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15363),
  ('VCDOORRR_a001_WatchdogReset', 'Cybertruck', 'A watchdog (external or internal) was not serviced in time.', 'Next reboot after alert is present.', 'Warns if the processor has experienced a reset due to watchdog reset.', 'Controller is MIA for some time.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15364),
  ('VCDOORRR_a002_PowerLossReset', 'Cybertruck', 'Sudden power loss.', 'Next reboot after alert is present.', 'Warns if the processor has experienced a reset due to power loss.', 'Controller is MIA for some time.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15365),
  ('VCDOORRR_a010_ExtSupplyVoltError', 'Cybertruck', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from 1 or more components is < 7.31. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from all components is > 7.31 V.', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from 1 or more components is outside of the expected range.', 'Features depending on the vehicle controller functionality may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15366),
  ('VCDOORRR_a015_NVMMError', 'Cybertruck', 'Non-volatile memory misconfiguration or underlying flash/filesystem error.', 'Bootup without indication.', 'An issue is indicated from the non-volatile memory manager.', 'Non-volatile memory records may be incorrect or missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15367),
  ('VCDOORRR_a057_HVP_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the HVP ECU is not received.', 'The electronic control unit (ECU) starts receiving the expected messages from the HVP ECU.', 'One or more of the expected messages the electronic control unit (ECU) receives periodically from the high voltage processor (HVP) ECU is not received, indicating the HVP may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle may be unable to drive. Charging may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15368),
  ('VCDOORRR_a059_inputResistanceHigh', 'Cybertruck', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is no longer higher than expected.', 'A large voltage drop is detected in the input power to the vehicle controller, indicating the resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'The vehicle controller may be unavailable due to lack of adequate input power, limiting vehicle functionality or making the vehicle inoperable, with at least one other alert specific to that condition present.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15369),
  ('VCDOORRR_a063_SwitchFault', 'Cybertruck', 'A condition is detected affecting switch functionality. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the switch affected and specific condition.', 'No condition affecting switch functionality is detected.', 'A condition affecting switch functionality has been detected.', 'The switch may not function or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15370),
  ('VCDOORRR_a082_VCRIGHT_IPC_MIA', 'Cybertruck', 'One or more of the expected messages from the VCRIGHT is not received over the IPC.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the VCRIGHT over the IPC.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the right vehicle controller (VCRIGHT) is not received over the interprocessor controller area network (IPC), indicating the VCRIGHT may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the VCRIGHT may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15371),
