  ('VCFRONT_a094_EPAS3P_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the EPAS3P ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the EPAS3P ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Primary Electronic Power-Assisted Steering (EPAS3P) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the EPAS3P ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the EPAS3P may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15629),
  ('VCFRONT_a095_CHG_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the CHG ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CHG ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the onboard charger (CHG) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CHG ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Charging may not start or may be interrupted unexpectedly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15630),
  ('VCFRONT_a096_OCS1P_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the OCS1P ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the OCS1P ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the 1st row passenger occupancy classification system (OCS1P) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the OCS1P ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle functions that depend on the OCS1P may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 15631),
  ('VCFRONT_a097_CMP_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the CMP ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CMP ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the air conditioning compressor (CMP) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CMP ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The HVAC system may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15632),
  ('VCFRONT_a098_DIR_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DIR ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DIR ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear drive inverter (DIR) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the DIR ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15633),
  ('VCFRONT_a099_PARK_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'An expected CAN message from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the park assist ECU is CAN active. The PARK ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_chGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_parkLVState is LV_ON.', 'All expected CAN messages  from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the PARK ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15634),
  ('VCFRONT_a100_CANbus_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'If 50% or more of the ECUs the local ECUs listens to are MIA, and the local ECU receives from more than 3 ECUs on this bus. An ECU is MIA if more than 50% of its messages are MIA and that ECU is considered CAN active (see specific ECU''s MIA alert for CAN active conditions).', 'setCondition is no longer true.', 'More than half of the ECUs on a either the VEH or PARTY bus are missing more than half their messages while the bus should be active.', 'Vehicle functionality may be degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15635),
  ('VCFRONT_a101_PM_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PM ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PM ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Pedal Monitor (PM) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PM ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15636),
  ('VCFRONT_a102_PTC_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PTC heater ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PTC heater ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Positive Temperature Coefficient (PTC) heater electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PTC heater ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Thermal management system features depending on PTC heater functionality may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15637),
  ('VCFRONT_a103_CP_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the CP ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the CP ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the charge port (CP) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the CP ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Charging may not start or may be interrupted unexpectedly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15638),
  ('VCFRONT_a105_TAS_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the TAS ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the TAS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the Tesla Air Suspension (TAS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the TAS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The air suspension may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15639),
  ('VCFRONT_a106_PCS_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the PCS ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the PCS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the power conversion system (PCS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the PCS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The vehicle may be unable to charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15640),
  ('VCFRONT_a107_BMS_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the HVBMS ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the HVBMS ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the high voltage (HV) Battery Management System (BMS) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the BMS ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The vehicle may be unable to drive or charge.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15641),
  ('VCFRONT_a108_DIF_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DIF ECU is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DIF ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the front drive inverter (DIF) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the DIF ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited. Thermal management system features depending on DIF functionality may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15642),
  ('VCFRONT_a110_GTW_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'An expected CAN message from the vehicle gateway (GTW) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the GTW is CAN active. The GTW is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) are received, or the GTW is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) was not received. Vehicle functions  that depend on CAN messages from the GTW may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Vehicle functions that depend on CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15643),
  ('VCFRONT_a111_EPBR_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The vehicle controller does not receive one or more of the expected messages from the EPBR ECU within the expected time frame.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the EPBR ECU.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the right Electronic Park Brake (EPBR) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received, indicating the EPBR ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The parking brake may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 15644),
