  ('VCLEFT_a137_PvUv', 'Cybertruck', 'The positive lead voltage measurement is lower than expected. The expected value is the lower of 16.5 volts, or the estimated PWM voltage.', 'Caliper state machine exits csmState CSM_FAULT', 'Motor positive lead voltage is lower than expected while active.', 'Caliper motor or harness may be damaged', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16469),
