  ('VCLEFT_a227_seatEncStallLift', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Current draw is nonzero and not stalling but encoder values don''t increase', 'The motor exits the motor stopped state', 'The motor isn''t providing encoder feedback.', 'Memory recall will be unavailable', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 16574),
