  ('VCLEFT_a251_seatUncalTrack', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The seat track motor is detected as uncalibrated (calibrated state of the seat track motor is 0).', 'The seat track motor is calibrated.', 'The seat track motor is not calibrated, which may cause position recall to be unavailable.', 'Position recall may be unavailable, meaning the preset user preferences for seat positions may also be unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16612),
