  ('VCLEFT_a278_TLVBMS_BmbHwOverCurrentFault', 'Cybertruck', 'The BMB device detects an over current condition.', 'The over current (OC) condition is resolved, and the low voltage (LV) battery pack is allowed to recover while vehicle is parked and LV battery is supported.', 'A Battery Monitoring Board (BMB) device detects a Hardware (HW) over current condition.', 'The eFuse may open, causing a loss of LV battery pack power and limiting LV battery support for vehicle electrical system.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16632),
