  ('VCLEFT_a297_TLVBMS_BmbHwOverTemperatureFault', 'Cybertruck', 'Any BMB device in the daisy chain detects an over temperature condition', 'No BMB devices in the daisy chain report an over temperature condition', 'A Battery Monitoring Board (BMB) device has detected an over temperature condition.', 'May indicate the battery pack is operating under unintended conditions. This alert may result in loss of pack power', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16650),
