  ('VCLEFT_a432_TLVBMS_ChargeRegulationFault', 'Cybertruck', 'The pack charge current is above the expected threshold for an extended period of time.', 'The pack charge current is within the expected threshold. If an external LV charger is in use, it should be removed once the vehicle is supporting the LV systems.', 'The Low Voltage Battery Management System (LVBMS) detects the pack charge current exceeded the expected threshold for an extended period of time.', 'The eFuse may open, causing a loss of LV battery pack power and limiting LV battery support for vehicle electrical system.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16792),
