  ('VCLEFT_a463_hvacLeftAirwaveLateralFault', 'Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'Left airwave lateral actuator detected a fault (check context data for type of fault)', 'Left airwave lateral actuator is not faulted', 'HVAC left airwave lateral actuator faulted.', 'The heater and the A/C and heater may be disabled', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 16820),
