  ('VCREAR_a225_epbActiveDecel', 'Cybertruck', 'ESM_state == ESM_DYNAMIC_EXTERNAL', 'ESM_state != ESM_DYNAMIC_EXTERNAL', 'Stability Control has begun Controlled Deceleration for Parking Brake.', 'Stability Control is actuating, Electronic Parking Brake may be idle faulted', 'Vehicle is applying brakes', 'PULL OVER SAFELY', 'customer;service', 17048),
