  ('VCREAR_a288_seatHeatHSDErrorRearRight', 'Cybertruck', 'The high side driver (HSD) for the rear right seat heater detects an error condition (overcurrent, short to ground, or thermal shutdown).', 'The error condition affecting the rear right seat heater is detected by the high side driver (HSD) as resolved.', 'The high side driver (HSD) for the rear right seat heater has detected an error condition, which may lead to the seat heater not performing as designed.', 'The rear right seat heater may not perform as designed.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17074),
