  ('VCRIGHTP_a301_wipersFactoryDisabled', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle is in Factory Mode and no communication from the wipers over local interconnect network (LIN) has been detected for more than 1 second.', 'The routine to enable wiper function has been run.', 'The wipers have been disabled while the vehicle is in Factory Mode. The wiper enable routine must be run to restore wiper function.', 'No wiper movement or function, even if wipers are connected.', 'Windshield wiper is unavailable', 'Schedule service if condition persists', 'customer;service-fix', 17185),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a374_coolantSovSolenoidFault', 'Semitruck', 'The liquid cooled condenser inlet solenoid is consuming less than 0.2 Amps, or greater than 2.0 Amps, when active', 'The liquid cooled condenser inlet solenoid is consuming between 0.2 Amps and 2.0 Amps when active', 'The liquid cooled condenser inlet solenoid has encountered an electrical fault (short, disconnect or internal).', 'HVAC cabin, cooling and heating, and powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17186),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a377_ambientTempSns', 'Semitruck', 'The sensor reads a power rail or ground reference voltage.', 'The sensor no longer reads a power rail or ground reference voltage.', 'The ambient temperature sensor has an electrical fault (disconnect, short, or internal). HVAC cabin cooling (air conditioning) and powertrain performance may be limited.', 'The refrigerant compressor may not run. HVAC cabin cooling (air conditioning) and powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17187),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a396_coolantLevelLow', 'Semitruck', 'The coolant is low or the coolant level sensor has an electrical fault (disconnect, short, or internal)', 'The coolant is no longer low and no faults are detected', 'The coolant level sensor is reporting that the coolant is not filled. Powertrain and HVAC performance may be limited.', 'Powertrain and HVAC performance may be limited.', 'Coolant low - Schedule service', 'Climate/driving performance may be limited', 'customer;service-fix', 17188),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a400_doorLatchHarnessShorted', 'Semitruck', 'VCRIGHTP measures a voltage greater than 1V on the outputs of the door latch motor connection while not actuating or braking the motor.', 'VCRIGHTP measures a voltage of 1V or less on the outputs of the door latch motor connection for at least 5 seconds while not actuating or braking the motor.', 'The primary right vehicle controller (VCRIGHTP) detects unexpected voltage on the cab door latch motor connection while not actuating or braking the motor.', 'Increased risk of the door opening unexpectedly.', 'Door latch assembly error detected', 'Latch may not function as expected', 'customer;service-fix', 17189),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a446_cabinHVACUnavailableContext', 'Semitruck', 'May set due to many possible conditions affecting thermal management system functionality. Alert log signal data should provide information on specific condition(s).', 'Condition(s) affecting thermal management system functionality no longer detected.', 'Condition(s) affecting the thermal management system have reduced cabin heating and/or cooling performance or made cabin heating and/or cooling unavailable.', 'Cabin heating and/or cooling performance may be limited, or cabin heating and/or cooling may be unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17190),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a448_manualHVACAlert', 'Semitruck', 'Manual control of HVAC system is limiting occupant comfort', 'HVAC is no longer controlled manually, or manual settings are no longer compromising occupant comfort', 'HVAC has manual mode settings such that it is affecting occupant comfort. This alert can set under nominal operating conditions and does not necessarily indicate an issue is affecting the vehicle.', 'Occupant comfort may not be optimal', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17191),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a465_wiperParkFault', 'Semitruck', 'The wiper was commanded to move and did not move from park position within 2 seconds or did not return to park position within 10 seconds', 'Cleared when the user turns off the wipers, turns them on back on to continuous slow or continuous fast, and the wiper starts moving again', 'The wiper is experiencing a fault related to movement from/to the park position.', 'The wiper will not move when commanded. Wash pump will not be operational.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17192),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a470_manualReleaseCoverRemoved', 'Semitruck', 'The VCRIGHTP detects a voltage indicating the microswitch for the manual release cover on the right cabin door is not pressed while the tractor parking brake is disengaged.', 'The VCRIGHTP detects a voltage indicating the microswitch for the manual release cover on the right cabin door is pressed, or the tractor parking brake is engaged.', 'While the tractor parking brake is disengaged, the primary right vehicle controller (VCRIGHTP) detects the manual release cover for the right cabin door has been removed, exposing the manual release cord.', 'If the manual release cover is removed while the tractor parking brake is disengaged, a warning will be present on the user interface (UI) informing the user that the manual release should not be pulled.', 'Do not open door unless vehicle is stationary', 'Emergency manual release cord is exposed', 'customer', 17193),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a471_manualReleaseSwitchFault', 'Semitruck', 'The microswitch for the manual release cover on the right cabin door reports a voltage that indicates there is a short or open circuit, or the state of the manual release cover is unable to determined.', 'The microswitch for the manual release cover on the right cabin door reports a voltage in the active or inactive range.', 'The right cabin door microswitch for the manual release cover detects a voltage that indicates there is a short or open circuit, or the state of the microswitch is unknown.', 'If the current state of the manual release cover is unknown, a warning may not be present to inform the user that the manual release should not be activated while the vehicle is in motion.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17194),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a480_vnf1048Fault', 'Semitruck', 'The VNF1048 chip reports a condition affecting its operation.', 'All reported conditions are no longer present.', 'There is an unexpected condition affecting a VNF1048 chip.', 'Affected eFuse may not be on.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17195),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a500_eFuseASICStateMismatch', 'Semitruck', 'Vehicle controller eFuse ASIC is not in the requested state', 'Vehicle Controller eFuse ASIC is back in the unlocked state or has been retried', 'The eFuse application-specific integrated circuit (ASIC) on the vehicle controller is in an unexpected state.', 'Vehicle Controller eFuse ASIC may not turn on or off as expected', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17196),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a523_eFuseThresholdsIncorrect', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects incorrect threshold values on its eFuse ASIC for 1 second.', 'The eFuse ASIC on the vehicle controller has correct threshold values set.', 'The eFuse application-specific integrated circuit (ASIC) on the vehicle controller has incorrect thresholds set.', 'The eFuse ASIC on the vehicle controller may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17197),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a538_hvacSystemNotNominal', 'Semitruck', 'The VCRIGHTP detects the HVAC system is not nominal for 30 seconds due to a condition. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The VCRIGHTP does not detect a condition on the HVAC system for 10 seconds, allowing the HVAC system to be nominal.', 'The primary right vehicle controller (VCRIGHTP) detects the HVAC system is not nominal due to a condition, which may cause Climate Keeper Mode functionality to be limited or unavailable.', 'Climate Keeper Mode functionality may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17198),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a539_dogModeMonitorTrip', 'Semitruck', 'May set due to one of the following reasons after Dog Mode is enabled for 10 minutes: (1) the interior cabin temperature exceeds the owner''s set or default threshold; (2) the interior cabin temperature monitor experiences a condition. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The interior cabin temperature is within the owner''s set or default threshold, or Dog Mode is disabled.', 'While Dog Mode is enabled for at least 10 minutes, the primary right vehicle controller (VCRIGHTP) detects one of the following: (1) the interior cabin temperature exceeds the owner''s set or default threshold; (2) the interior cabin temperature monitor experiences a condition.', 'Dog Mode functionality may be limited or unavailable. The owner''s set threshold for the interior cabin temperature may also be reset.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17199),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a591_rightExteriorStairwellLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The right exterior stairwell light driver has reported a fault.', 'The right exterior stairwell light driver is no longer reporting a fault.', 'A fault has been detected with the right exterior stairwell light.', 'The right exterior stairwell light may not be working.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17200),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a592_leftCargoDoorReleaseFailed', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects that the cargo door latch did not transition to the ajar (or secondary) position after commanding it to open.', 'The vehicle controller detects that the cargo door latch transitioned to the ajar (or secondary) position.', 'The vehicle controller did not detect a transition in the left cargo door switch states after the latch was commanded to open.', 'Left cargo door latch did not complete the requested release. The door may not be securely closed, the door may be unable to release, or a sensing failure is causing the latch to report closed incorrectly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17201),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a593_rightCargoDoorReleaseFailed', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects that the cargo door latch did not transition to the ajar (or secondary) position after commanding it to open.', 'The vehicle controller detects that the cargo door latch transitioned to the ajar (or secondary) position.', 'The vehicle controller did not detect a transition in the right cargo door switch states after the latch was commanded to open.', 'Right cargo door latch did not complete the requested release. The door may not be securely closed, the door may be unable to release, or a sensing failure is causing the latch to report closed incorrectly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17202),
  ('VCRIGHTP_a594_rightDoorCabinReleaseFailed', 'Semitruck', 'Latch sensor indicates status transitioned to CLOSED after attempting OPENING.', 'Latch reports OPENING or OPENED.', 'Right cabin door latch did not report OPENED following OPENING leading to ambiguous physical state.', 'Right cabin door latch did not complete the requested release. The door may not be securely closed, the door may be unable to release, or a sensing failure is causing the latch to report closed incorrectly.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17203),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a001_WatchdogReset', 'Semitruck', 'A watchdog (external or internal) was not serviced in time.', 'Next reboot after alert is present.', 'Warns if the processor has experienced a reset due to watchdog reset.', 'Controller is MIA for some time.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17204),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a015_NVMMError', 'Semitruck', 'Non-volatile memory misconfiguration or underlying flash/filesystem error.', 'Bootup without indication.', 'An issue is indicated from the non-volatile memory manager.', 'Non-volatile memory records may be incorrect or missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17205),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a059_inputResistanceHigh', 'Semitruck', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is no longer higher than expected.', 'A large voltage drop is detected in the input power to the vehicle controller, indicating the resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'The vehicle controller may be unavailable due to lack of adequate input power, limiting vehicle functionality or making the vehicle inoperable, with at least one other alert specific to that condition present.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17206),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a063_SwitchFault', 'Semitruck', 'A condition is detected affecting switch functionality. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the switch affected and specific condition.', 'No condition affecting switch functionality is detected.', 'A condition affecting switch functionality has been detected.', 'The switch may not function or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17207),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a083_DIRE1L', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Left ECU (DIRE1L) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DIRE1L is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Left ECU (DIRE1L) are being received or the DIRE1L drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Left (DIRE1L) were not received while in drive.', 'Drive functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17208),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a084_DIRE1R', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Right ECU (DIRE1R) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DIRE1R is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Right ECU (DIRE1R) are being received or the DIRE1L drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from Drive Inverter Rear Axle 1 Right (DIRE1R) were not received while in drive.', 'Drive functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17209),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a085_DIRE', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle ECU (DIRE) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DIRE is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle ECU (DIRE) are being received or the DIRE drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from Drive Inverter Rear Axle (DIRE) were not received while in drive.', 'Drive functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17210),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a086_DIRE2', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 2 ECU (DIRE2) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DIRE2 is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Inverter Rear Axle 2 ECU (DIRE2) are being received or the DIRE drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from Drive Inverter Rear Axle 2 (DIRE2) were not received while in drive.', 'Drive functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17211),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a087_STARC', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the STARC (Stationary Resonant Converter) ECU hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the STARC is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the STARC (Stationary Resonant Converter) ECU are being received or the STARC drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from STARC (Stationary Resonant Converter) were not received while in drive.', 'Vehicle Medium Voltage (MV) functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17212),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a088_SAS_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the SAS (Steering Angle Sensor) ECU hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the SAS is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the SAS (Steering Angle Sensor) ECU are being received or the SAS is expected to be CAN inactive.', 'One of more of the expected CAN messages from SAS (Steering Angle Sensor) were not received.', 'Automatic turn signal cancelling may be degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17213),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a092_VCSEATD_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Driver Seat Controller ECU (VCSEATD) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the VCSEATD is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_chGoToSleep is 0.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Driver Seat Controller ECU (VCSEATD) are being received or the VCSEATD ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from Driver Seat Controller (VCSEATD) were not received.', 'Seat control functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17214),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a103_CP_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the ChargePort ECU (CP) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the CP is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_hvsGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_cpLVRequest is LV_ON.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the ChargePort ECU (CP) are being received or the CP ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the ChargePort (CP) were not received.', 'Charging functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17215),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a107_BMS_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the High Voltage Battery Management System ECU (BMS) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the BMS is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_hvsGoToSleep is 0.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the BMS ECU are being received or the High Voltage Battery Management System ECU (BMS) is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the High Voltage Battery Management System (BMS) were not received.', 'Drive and charging functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17216),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a109_RCM_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Restraint Control Module ECU (RCM) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the RCM is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_privateGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_rcmLVRequest is LV_ON.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Restraint Control Module ECU (RCM) are being received or the RCM ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Restraint Control Module (RCM) were not received.', 'Functionality associated with the RCM may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17217),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a110_GTW_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'An expected CAN message from the vehicle gateway (GTW) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the GTW is CAN active. The GTW is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) are received, or the GTW is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) was not received. Vehicle functions that depend on CAN messages from the GTW may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Vehicle functions that depend on CAN messages from the vehicle gateway (GTW) may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17218),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a115_VCSEC_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Security Controller ECU (VCSEC) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the VCSEC ECU is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Security Controller ECU (VCSEC) are being received or the VCSEC ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Security Controller (VCSEC) were not received.', 'Lock and security functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17219),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a119_SCCM_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Steering Column Control Module ECU (SCCM) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the SCCM is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_sccmLVRequest is LV_ON.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Steering Column Control Module ECU (SCCM) are being received or the SCCM ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Steering Column Control Module (SCCM) were not received.', 'Shifter functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17220),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a120_DI_DRIVE_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Interface ECU (DI) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DI is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCLEFTS_vehGoToSleep is 0 AND VCLEFTS_vehiclePowerState is VEHICLE_POWER_STATE_DRIVE.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Interface ECU (DI) are being received or the DI drive mode is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Drive Interface (DI) were not received while in drive.', 'Drive functionality may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17221),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a121_IAPU_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Intelligent Air Processing Unit (IAPU) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the IAPU is CAN active.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Intelligent Air Processing Unit (IAPU) are being received or the IAPU ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Intelligent Air Processing Unit (IAPU) were not received.', 'Air suspension leveling may not be available.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17222),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a122_DI_MIA', 'Semitruck', 'A message the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Interface ECU (DI) hasn''t been received within the expected timeout or the drop rate is too high while the DI is CAN active.', 'All messages the local ECU expects to receive from the Drive Interface ECU (DI) are being received or the DI is CAN inactive.', 'One or more of the expected CAN messages from the Drive Interface (DI) were not received.', 'Functionality dependent on wheel speed may be missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17223),
