  ('VCRIGHTS_a235_ptTempSnsIrrational', 'Semitruck', 'An irrational difference in the powertrain coolant temperature sensor values and the drive inverter''s own temperature sensor values.', 'Difference between the powertrain coolant temperature sensor value and the drive inverter temperature sensor values is nominal.', 'The powertrain''s coolant temperature sensor is reporting an incorrect value. Possible VCFRONT internal electrical issue. Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17247),
