  ('VCRIGHTS_a349_radiatorPumpRestarting', 'Semitruck', 'Radiator coolant pumps have recovered from a fault, and is restarting', 'Pump restart procedure is completed (can take up to 30 seconds)', 'Radiator coolant pumps will not operate while restarting.', 'Powertrain performance will be limited, coolant flow will be reduced.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17266),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a355_coolantSysLockout', 'Semitruck', 'May set due to any of the following: (1) vehicle is not factory gated; (2) coolant is not filled; (3) coolant fill / drain routine is active.', 'May clear due to any of the following: (1) vehicle is factory gated; (2) coolant is filled; (3) coolant fill / drain routine is complete.', 'The vehicle controller detects the vehicle is not factory gated or the coolant is not filled, causing the coolant pumps to turn off and the coolant valve to be in Series or No Bypass mode.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning may be limited or unavailable. Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17267),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a356_refrigSysLockout', 'Semitruck', 'May set due to any of the following: (1) vehicle is not factory gated; (2) refrigerant is not filled; (3) refrigerant fill / drain routine is active.', 'May clear due to any of the following: (1) vehicle is factory gated; (2) refrigerant is filled; (3) refrigerant fill / drain routine is complete.', 'The vehicle controller detects the vehicle is not factory gated or the refrigerant is not filled, causing the compressor to be unavailable and the refrigerant valves (solenoid or electronic expansion valves (EXV)) to remain open.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning may be limited or unavailable. Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17268),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a361_washerFluidLowMomentary', 'Semitruck', 'Washer fluid just became low, OR vehicle exited park gear while washer fluid is low, OR wash pump attempted while washer fluid is low', 'Cleared 8 seconds after being set', 'Windshield washer fluid is low.', 'No washer fluid to wipe windshield.', 'Windshield washer fluid low', 'Not Available', 'customer', 17269),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a367_dischargeRoutineEntered', 'Semitruck', 'System trigger condition for the HV Battery Discharge routine was met and the routine attempted to start.', 'Will clear automatically', 'HV Battery Discharge routine entered, expect the HV Battery Discharge routine to run.', 'Refer to HV Battery Discharge routine documentation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17270),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a368_dischargeRoutineExited', 'Semitruck', 'System condition for the HV Battery Discharge routine are not met and the routine is exiting.', 'Will clear automatically', 'HV Battery Discharge routine exited, the HV Battery Discharge will not run until reset conditions are met.', 'Refer to HV Battery Discharge routine documentation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17271),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a369_reducedPowerDischarge', 'Semitruck', 'System condition are not met for full power discharge of the HV battery.', 'Will clear automatically', 'HV Battery Discharge routine is running with reduced power, the battery will discharge at a lower rate than expected.', 'Refer to HV Battery Discharge routine documentation.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17272),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a391_frunkLatchSwitchFault', 'Semitruck', 'Both front trunk (frunk) switches are pressed, or both frunk switches are unpressed, or any frunk switch is shorted / disconnected.', 'Front trunk (frunk) latch switch values are in expected range.', 'Unexpected front trunk (frunk) latch switch values are present, which may result in the frunk state not matching the state indicated in the touchscreen user interface (UI).', 'The state of the front trunk (frunk) latch (open or closed) may be inaccurate. Front trunk (frunk) state may not match the state indicated in the touchscreen user interface (UI). For example, the UI may report the frunk as open when closed, or closed when open.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17273),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a394_pressureSensorCheckFault', 'Semitruck', 'One or more of the refrigerant pressure sensors is faulted', 'Pressure sensors have been detected as operating nominally - may take up to 15 minutes', 'One or more of the refrigerant pressure sensors is faulted.', 'Refrigerant compressor may be impacted along with general HVAC functionality', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17274),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a399_frunkNeverReportedOpen', 'Semitruck', 'Set during first initialization of the controller and sets again if the front trunk latch reports disconnected for greater than 20 seconds.', 'The front trunk latch switches both report that they are not pressed.', 'The front trunk latch switches have never simultaneously reported an unpressed state. Alert state persists through vehicle sleep.', 'This can indicate the front trunk latch sensing is degraded and stuck reporting as closed.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17275),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a409_invalidConfiguration', 'Semitruck', 'Current device configuration doesn''t match the desired configuration.', 'ECU reset.', 'The specified device may not work as expected.', 'The specified device may not work as expected. A reset will clear the fault and correctly configure the device.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17276),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a446_cabinHVACUnavailableContext', 'Semitruck', 'May set due to many possible conditions affecting thermal management system functionality. Alert log signal data should provide information on specific condition(s).', 'Condition(s) affecting thermal management system functionality no longer detected.', 'Condition(s) affecting the thermal management system have reduced cabin heating and/or cooling performance or made cabin heating and/or cooling unavailable.', 'Cabin heating and/or cooling performance may be limited, or cabin heating and/or cooling may be unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17277),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a447_cabinHVACUnavailable', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects a condition(s) affecting the Thermal Management System. Alert log signal data for the cabinHVACUnavailableContext alert should provide more information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The vehicle controller no longer detects a condition(s) affecting the Thermal Management System.', 'The vehicle controller detects a condition(s) affecting the Thermal Management System that prevents it from performing as designed.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning may be limited or unavailable. Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Cabin climate control system requires service', 'Cabin heating / cooling limited or unavailable', 'customer;service-fix', 17278),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a459_thermalFillAndDrive', 'Semitruck', 'The Thermal Fill Drain service routine is run.', 'The Thermal Fill Drain service routine is stopped.', 'The vehicle controller detects that the Thermal Fill Drain service routine is being run while the vehicle is in Drive.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning and heating may be limited or unavailable. Powertrain performance may be limited.', 'Thermal system fill / drain detected while in drive', 'Powertrain / HVAC performance may be limited', 'customer;service-fix', 17279),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a460_hardIsentropicTdFailed', 'Semitruck', 'The isentropic check for the TD is unsuccessful.', 'Clears automatically when vehicle is asleep.', 'The vehicle controller detects the isentropic check for the refrigerant discharge temperature (TD) is unsuccessful, indicating the A/C compressor mass flow rate is below the expected level.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning and heating may be limited or unavailable. Battery heating and cooling performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17280),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a461_refrigerantNotCommissioned', 'Semitruck', 'The Thermal Fill Drain service routine is run.', 'The Heat Pump Commissioning service routine is run.', 'The refrigerant system has not been commissioned or has been decommissioned by the Thermal Fill Drain service routine.', 'Powertrain and HVAC performance will be limited, the compressor will be limited to 2000rpm.', 'Refrigerant system decommissioned - HVAC limited', 'Run heat pump commissioning routine to resolve', 'customer;service-fix', 17281),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a463_frunkSensorService', 'Semitruck', 'Both switches are pressed, both switches are unpressed, or any switch is shorted/disconnected', 'Frunk latch switches are in expected range', 'Frunk sensor requires servicing.', 'Frunk behavior may be less optimized', 'Hood latch sensor requires service', 'Schedule service', 'customer;service-fix', 17282),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a464_highFlowIndexHighSubcoolFlagged', 'Semitruck', 'This alert is set when refrigerant flow index is above expected levels and subcool is high', 'This alert will clear on sleep', 'Discrepancy between compressor and EXV estimated refrigerant flow rates.', 'Thermal performance may be degraded', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17283),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a465_lowFlowIndexHighSubcoolFlagged', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle detects that refrigerant flow index is below expected levels and subcool is high.', 'The alert will clear once the vehicle wakes from Sleep mode or when low flow index is no longer observed at high subcool.', 'The flow index value is low at high subcool. The refrigerant flow rate through the electronic expansion valves (EXV) is not meeting the expected value when compared to the compressor refrigerant flow rate.', 'The thermal system may not perform as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17284),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a466_highFlowIndexLowSubcoolFlagged', 'Semitruck', 'This alert is set when refrigerant flow index is above expected levels and subcool is low', 'This alert will clear on sleep', 'Discrepancy between compressor and EXV estimated refrigerant flow rates.', 'Thermal performance may be degraded', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17285),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a467_lowPowerIndexFlagged', 'Semitruck', 'The A/C compressor power index is lower than expected.', 'Clears automatically when vehicle is asleep.', 'The vehicle controller detects the actual A/C compressor power is lower than expected.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning and heating may be limited or unavailable. Battery heating and cooling performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17286),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a470_implausiblePdPlDetected', 'Semitruck', 'Pd-Pl is greater than 6 bar for 5 consecutive seconds.', 'Pd-Pl is less than 4 bar for 5 consecutive seconds.', 'Difference between the discharge pressure and liquid pressure (Pd-Pl) increased. Discharge lines or Liquid Cooled Condenser (LCC) or Shut Off Valve (SOV) may be blocked.', 'Thermal performance is degraded.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17287),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a480_vnf1048Fault', 'Semitruck', 'The VNF1048 chip reports a condition affecting its operation.', 'All reported conditions are no longer present.', 'There is an unexpected condition affecting a VNF1048 chip.', 'Affected eFuse may not be on.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17288),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a490_coolantPumpsNotIdentified', 'Semitruck', 'The coolant fluid fill/drain routine is run', 'The coolant pump identificiation routine is run', 'At least one coolant pump hasn''t been identified and configured, the coolant loop NVH and/or performance may deteriorate.', 'Powertrain and HVAC performance will be limited. NVH may be increased.', 'Coolant pumps not identified', 'Check TBX for Coolant Pump Identification', 'service-fix', 17289),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a492_rightFrontSideMarkerLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'An internal condition with the right side marker LEDs or the headlamp ECU''s LED driver is detected.', 'Clears when the headlamp is powered off or reset (example: sleep, FW update, or manual power cycle). Note: If the condition persists, the alert will continue to set each time the side marker is used, until the underlying condition is resolved.', 'A condition affecting right front side marker functionality (small amber light at top corner of headlamp) has been detected - the right front side marker may be degraded or disabled.', 'The right side marker may not be illuminating.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17290),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a500_eFuseASICStateMismatch', 'Semitruck', 'Vehicle controller eFuse ASIC is not in the requested state', 'Vehicle Controller eFuse ASIC is back in the unlocked state or has been retried', 'The eFuse application-specific integrated circuit (ASIC) on the vehicle controller is in an unexpected state.', 'Vehicle Controller eFuse ASIC may not turn on or off as expected', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17291),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a504_airInRefrigerantDetected', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle detects at least two of the following: low flow index at high subcool on either Chiller Only or Evap Only modes or abnormally low suction superheat.', 'The alert will clear once the vehicle wakes from Sleep mode or when low flow index is no longer observed at high subcool and suction superheat is no longer abnormally low.', 'Low flow index has been detected at high subcool at steady state or suction superheat is found to be abnormally low, which indicates that air bubbles are circulating in the refrigerant system.', 'The thermal system may not perform as expected and the electronic expansion valves (EXV) will open wider to accommodate the air bubbles in the system.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17292),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a511_STITCHSaturationLoadShed12V', 'Semitruck', 'The Right 12V STITCH EFuse current is too close to Right 12V STITCH''s max capability for 1s', 'The Right 12V STITCH EFuse current is less than the Right 12V STITCH''s max capability until the Right 12V STITCH EFuse Saturation Loadshed Stage is MIN', 'The Right 12V STITCH EFuse current is reaching the Right 12V STITCH''s max capability.', 'Convenience features will be disabled to limit LV system current draw', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17293),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a512_STITCHSaturationLoadShed24V', 'Semitruck', 'The Right 24V STITCH EFuse current is too close to Right 24V STITCH''s max capability for 1s', 'The Right 24V STITCH EFuse current is less than the Right 24V STITCH''s max capability until the Right 24V STITCH EFuse Saturation Loadshed Stage is MIN', 'The Right 24V STITCH EFuse current is reaching the Right 24V STITCH''s max capability.', 'Convenience features will be disabled to limit LV system current draw', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17294),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a523_eFuseThresholdsIncorrect', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects incorrect threshold values on its eFuse ASIC for 1 second.', 'The eFuse ASIC on the vehicle controller has correct threshold values set.', 'The eFuse application-specific integrated circuit (ASIC) on the vehicle controller has incorrect thresholds set.', 'The eFuse ASIC on the vehicle controller may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17295),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a531_lowPowerIndexFlaggedUserFacing', 'Semitruck', 'The compressor power index, which compares expected compressor power consumption against actual consumption, drops below expected levels.', 'Clears automatically after the first 30 seconds of each drive cycle, while the condition persists and alert continues to set.', 'The compressor power index is lower than expected, which typically indicates a condition affecting the compressor. This can also indicate a condition affecting the discharge or suction pressure sensors. The compressor power index measures the ratio of estimated nominal compressor power consumption against electrical power the compressor actually consumes. A low index value indicates the compressor is drawing / consuming significantly more power than a nominal compressor would be expected to consume.', 'Thermal system may show reduced effectiveness. Cabin climate control performance may be limited, with cabin heating / cooling not performing at expected levels.', 'Cabin climate control system requires service', 'Cabin heating / cooling limited or unavailable', 'customer;service-fix', 17296),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a560_compressorHighSuperheat', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle controller detects low refrigerant, a blocked refrigerant filter, or other refrigerant related conditions on the A/C compressor.', 'The vehicle controller detects the vehicle power state transition from conditioning to accessory.', 'The vehicle controller detects a refrigerant condition, such as low refrigerant or a blocked refrigerator filter, which may prevent the A/C compressor from operating as expected due to high suction superheat if no other heat pump modes are available.', 'Cabin climate control system air conditioning and heating may be limited or unavailable. Battery heating and cooling performance may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17297),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a567_rightFrontTurnLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The headlamp ECU is MIA on LIN (not responding to Local Interconnect Network traffic) while powered on, or an internal condition with the turn signal LEDs or the headlamp ECU''s LED driver is detected.', 'Clears when the headlamp is powered off or reset (example: sleep, FW update, or manual power cycle). Note: If the condition persists, the alert will continue to set each time the headlamp is powered back on / turn signal is used, until the underlying condition is resolved.', 'A condition affecting right front turn signal functionality has been detected - the right front turn signal may be degraded or disabled, and remaining right side turn signals will fast blink.', 'Right side turn signals will fast blink', 'Right front turn signal malfunction detected', 'Inspect light function - Schedule service if needed', 'customer;service-fix', 17298),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a569_rightDaytimeRunningLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'An internal condition with the daytime running light (DRL) LEDs or the headlamp ECU''s LED driver is detected.', 'Clears when the headlamp is powered off or reset (example: sleep, FW update, or manual power cycle). Note: If the condition persists, the alert will continue to set each time the DRL is used, until the underlying condition is resolved.', 'A condition affecting right daytime running light (DRL) functionality has been detected - the right daytime running light may be degraded or disabled.', 'Right daytime running light (DRL) may be partially or fully disabled', 'Right daytime running light malfunction detected', 'Inspect light function - Schedule service if needed', 'customer;service-fix', 17299),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a570_headlampsAdaptedToLeftHandTraffic', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle is now located in a region with left-hand traffic, meaning vehicles are being driven on the left side of the road.', 'Clears after 15s', 'The vehicle controller(s) controlling the headlamps have commanded the headlights to adjust to a beam pattern that is optimized for left-hand traffic as the vehicle is now located in a region with left-hand traffic.', 'Headlight illumination will be optimized for regions with left-hand traffic.', 'Headlights adapted for left hand traffic', 'Based on location', 'customer', 17300),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a571_headlampsAdaptedToRightHandTraffic', 'Semitruck', 'The vehicle is now located in a region with right-hand traffic, meaning vehicles are being driven on the right side of the road.', 'Clears after 15s', 'The vehicle controller(s) controlling the headlamps have commanded the headlights to adjust to a beam pattern that is optimized for right-hand traffic as the vehicle is now located in a region with right-hand traffic.', 'Headlight illumination will be optimized for regions with right-hand traffic.', 'Headlights adapted for right hand traffic', 'Based on location', 'customer', 17301),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a583_trailerClearanceIDLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The trailer''s clearance or ID light driver has reported a fault.', 'The trailer''s clearance or ID light driver is no longer reporting a fault.', 'A fault has been detected with the trailer''s clearance or ID light.', 'The trailer''s clearance or ID light may not be working.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17302),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a584_trailerTailLicenseLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The trailer''s tail or license light driver has reported a fault.', 'The trailer''s tail or license light driver is no longer reporting a fault.', 'A fault has been detected with the trailer''s tail or license light (trailer Clearance light 2).', 'The trailer''s tail or license light may not be working.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17303),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a585_bothHeadlampsInternalError', 'Semitruck', 'For both headlamps, the SSL100 pixel matrix detects non-functional pixels or has communication issues, or the voltage measured across the Lowbeam Prefield, DRL segments, or Turn LEDs (Model S only) is out of range, or the LED drivers in the ECU have reported status flags, or certain values programmed in the SSL100 EEPROM are out of range, or the fan current is out of range.', 'Left and right headlamps no longer report matrix manager, LED, HSD, or Boolean status errors indicating one or more conditions affecting functionality of both headlamps.', 'Left and right headlamps report simultaneous matrix manager, LED, High Side Driver (HSD), or Boolean status errors indicating a condition affecting functionality of both headlamps.', 'Certain light functions or the headlamp fan may be degraded or disabled for both headlamps.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17304),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a586_rightLowOrHighBeamLightCondition', 'Semitruck', 'An internal condition affecting the low beam (dipped beam) or high beam (main beam) LEDs, pixels, or the headlamp ECU''s LED drivers is detected.', 'Clears when the headlamp is powered off or reset. This may occur when the vehicle sleeps, installs a firmware (FW) update, or encounters a manual power cycle. If the condition persists, the alert will continue to set each time the low beam (dipped beam) or high beam (main beam) is used until the underlying condition is resolved.', 'A condition affecting right low beam (dipped beam) or high beam (main beam) functionality has been detected - the right low beam or high beam may be degraded or disabled.', 'Right low beam (dipped beam) or high beam (main beam) may be partially or fully disabled.', 'Right headlight malfunction detected', 'Inspect light function - Schedule service if needed', 'customer;service-fix', 17305),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a587_trailerBrakeLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The trailer''s brake light driver has reported a fault.', 'The trailer''s brake light driver is no longer reporting a fault.', 'A fault has been detected with the trailer''s brake light.', 'The trailer''s brake light may not be working.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17306),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a594_rightReverseLightFault', 'Semitruck', 'The right reverse light driver has reported a fault.', 'The right reverse light driver is no longer reporting a fault.', 'A fault has been detected with the right reverse light.', 'The right reverse light may not be working.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17307),
  ('VCRIGHTS_a596_rightHeadlampInternalError', 'Semitruck', 'The SSL100 pixel matrix detects non-functional pixels or has communication issues, or the voltage measured across the boost rail, Lowbeam Prefield, DRL, Turn1/2 LEDs is out of range, or the LED drivers in the ECU have reported status flags, or certain values programmed in the SSL100 EEPROM are out of range, or the fan current is out of range.', 'Headlamp power cycle (this occurs during sleep)', 'An internal condition affecting right headlamp functionality has been detected - certain light functions or the headlamp fan may be degraded or disabled.', 'Certain light functions or the headlamp fan may be degraded or disabled. These functions will retry after the next headlamp power cycle (which occurs during sleep)', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17308),
  ('VCRIGHT_a001_WatchdogReset', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A watchdog (external or internal) was not serviced in time.', 'Next reboot after alert is present.', 'Warns if the processor has experienced a reset due to watchdog reset.', 'Controller is MIA for some time.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17309),
  ('VCRIGHT_a010_ExtSupplyVoltError', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from 1 or more components is < 7.31. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the specific condition(s) detected.', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from all components is > 7.31 V.', 'The vehicle controller detects the supply voltage from 1 or more components is outside of the expected range.', 'Features depending on the vehicle controller functionality may be unavailable or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17310),
  ('VCRIGHT_a015_NVMMError', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Non-volatile memory misconfiguration or underlying flash/filesystem error.', 'Bootup without indication.', 'An issue is indicated from the non-volatile memory manager.', 'Non-volatile memory records may be incorrect or missing.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17311),
  ('VCRIGHT_a057_HVP_MIA', 'Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the HVP ECU is not received.', 'The electronic control unit (ECU) starts receiving the expected messages from the HVP ECU.', 'One or more of the expected messages the electronic control unit (ECU) receives periodically from the high voltage processor (HVP) ECU is not received, indicating the HVP may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle may be unable to drive. Charging may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17312),
  ('VCRIGHT_a059_inputResistanceHigh', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'Estimated resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is no longer higher than expected.', 'A large voltage drop is detected in the input power to the vehicle controller, indicating the resistance on the input power feed to the vehicle controller is higher than expected.', 'The vehicle controller may be unavailable due to lack of adequate input power, limiting vehicle functionality or making the vehicle inoperable, with at least one other alert specific to that condition present.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17313),
  ('VCRIGHT_a063_SwitchFault', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+', 'A condition is detected affecting switch functionality. Alert log signal data should provide more information on the switch affected and specific condition.', 'No condition affecting switch functionality is detected.', 'A condition affecting switch functionality has been detected.', 'The switch may not function or may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17314),
  ('VCRIGHT_a073_BCS2C_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCS2C is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCS2C.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the 2nd row center seat body controller (BCS2C) is not received, indicating the BCS2C may be unavailable (MIA).', '2nd row center seat features depending on BCS2C functionality, including seat buckle and heating pad, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17315),
  ('VCRIGHT_a074_BCS2L_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCS2L is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCS2L.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the 2nd row left seat body controller (BCS2L) is not received, indicating the BCS2L may be unavailable (MIA).', '2nd row left seat features depending on BCS2L functionality, including seat buckle and heating pad, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17316),
  ('VCRIGHT_a075_BCS2R_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCS2R is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCS2R.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the 2nd row right seat body controller (BCS2R) is not received, indicating the BCS2R may be unavailable (MIA).', '2nd row right seat features depending on BCS2R functionality, including seat buckle and heating pad, may be limited or unavailable.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17317),
  ('VCRIGHT_a076_BCRPM_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCRPM is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCRPM.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the rear passenger door body controller (BCRPM) is not received, indicating the BCRPM may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The rear passenger side falcon door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17318),
  ('VCRIGHT_a077_BCRDM_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the BCRDM is not received.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the BCRDM.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the body controller for the rear driver door (BCRDM) is not received, indicating the BCRDM may be unavailable (MIA).', 'The rear driver side falcon door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17319),
  ('VCRIGHT_a078_BCFALCP_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'An expected CAN message from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the BCFALCP is CAN active. The BCFALCP is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the BCFALCP is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Body Controller - Falcon EM Controller - Passenger Side (BCFALCP) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. The passenger side Falcon door may not function as expected.', 'The passenger side Falcon door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17320),
  ('VCRIGHT_a079_BCFPM_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'An expected CAN message from the Body Controller - Front Passenger Door (BCFPM) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the BCFPM is CAN active. The ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the Body Controller - Front Passenger Door (BCFPM) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the BCFPM is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Body Controller - Front Passenger Door (BCFPM) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. The front passenger side door may not function as expected.', 'The front passenger side door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17321),
  ('VCRIGHT_a080_BCFDM_MIA', 'Cybertruck;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+', 'An expected CAN message from the Body Controller - Front Driver Door (BCFDM) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the BCFDM is CAN active. The BCFDM is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_vehGoToSleep is 0.', 'All expected CAN messages from the Body Controller - Front Driver Door (BCFDM) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the BCFDM is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Body Controller - Front Driver Door (BCFDM) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. The front driver side door may not function as expected.', 'The front driver side door may not function as expected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17322),
