  ('VCRIGHT_a414_undervoltageSelfTestFailure', 'Cybertruck', 'The Right Domain Undervoltage self-test does not succeed. If a stuck-on or stuck-off condition is present, specific information can be found in the undervoltage self-test stuck-on or stuck-off debugging alerts.', 'Vehicle controller reset or successful Right Domain Undervoltage self-test.', 'The Right Domain Undervoltage self-test did not pass, as a condition affecting a load on the Right Domain was detected during the self-test.', 'The undervoltage protection circuit may not be functional.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service-fix', 17624),
