  ('VCSEAT2L_a099_PARK_MIA', 'Model Y 2025+', 'An expected CAN message from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) has not been received within the expected timeout, or the message drop rate is too high while the park assist ECU is CAN active. The PARK ECU is considered CAN active when VCFRONT_chGoToSleep is 0 AND VCFRONT_parkLVState is LV_ON.', 'All expected CAN messages  from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) are received, or the PARK ECU is CAN inactive.', 'One or more expected Controller Area Network (CAN) messages from the Park Assist (PARK) electronic control unit (ECU) was not received. Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Autopark and Summon functions may be unavailable, or their performance may be affected.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17782),
