  ('VCSEAT2L_a120_DI_DRIVE_MIA', 'Model Y 2025+', 'One or more of the expected messages from the DI ECU is not received while the vehicle is in Drive.', 'The vehicle controller starts receiving the expected messages from the DI ECU while the vehicle is in Drive, or the vehicle is no longer in Drive.', 'One or more of the messages the vehicle controller receives periodically from the drive interface (DI) electronic control unit (ECU) is not received while the vehicle is in Drive, indicating the DI ECU may be unavailable (MIA).', 'Vehicle speed and power may be limited.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17800),
