  ('VCSEAT2R_a263_seatTrackStallDebug', 'Model Y 2025+', 'Current draw exceeds stall limit.', 'The motor is not in a movement state. It may also be in a movement state, but has not detected a stall.', 'The seat track motor has unexpectedly stalled.', 'Motor will recalibrate if the stall is in an expected region, do nothing otherwise.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 17900),
