  ('VCSEC_a133_alarmTriggered', 'Cybertruck;Model 3 2017-2023;Model 3 2024+;Model S 2021+;Model X 2021+;Model Y;Model Y 2025+;Semitruck', 'One or more closures changed state from closed to open, or intrusion sensor was triggered (only in applicable vehicles), while the vehicle alarm system was active.', 'Either a nearby key is authenticated or the car is unlocked remotely.', 'An unauthorized use of the vehicle was detected. Vehicle will sound alarm until authenticated to unlock.', 'Vehicle alarm will sound and will not stop until vehicle is authenticated to unlock.', 'Not Available', 'Not Available', 'service', 18175),
